Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.12,*ENG,4,0,0,0,,It's beautiful here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:40.26,*ENG,5,0,0,0,,It was our aunt's. We used to come here as kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.36,*ENG,6,0,0,0,,The Order uses it now as a safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.98,*ENG,7,0,0,0,,What's left of us at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.83,*ENG,8,0,0,0,,Muggles think these things keep evil away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.71,*ENG,9,0,0,0,,But they're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.55,*ENG,10,0,0,0,,I need to talk to the Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:10.87,*ENG,11,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:14.29,*ENG,12,0,0,0,,Alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:20.77,*ENG,13,0,0,0,,You probably don't remember that you--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:24.03,*ENG,14,0,0,0,,That I showed you to your vault, the first time you came to Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.08,*ENG,15,0,0,0,,Even amongst Goblins, you are famous Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.46,*ENG,16,0,0,0,,- You buried the elf? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.51,*ENG,17,0,0,0,,And brought me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.63,*ENG,18,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.67,*ENG,19,0,0,0,,Pretty unusual, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.31,*ENG,20,0,0,0,,How did you come by the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.66,*ENG,21,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.74,*ENG,22,0,0,0,,Why did Bellatrix Lestrange think it should be in her vault at Gringotts?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.84,*ENG,23,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:16.12,*ENG,24,0,0,0,,The sword presented itself to us, in moment of need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.65,*ENG,25,0,0,0,,We didn't steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:24.66,*ENG,26,0,0,0,,There is a sword in Madam Lestrange's vault identical to this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:26.60,*ENG,27,0,0,0,,But it is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:28.69,*ENG,28,0,0,0,,It was placed there this past summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:30.40,*ENG,29,0,0,0,,And she never suspected it was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.83,*ENG,30,0,0,0,,The replica is very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:35.28,*ENG,31,0,0,0,,Only a goblin would recognize that this is the true Sword of Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.40,*ENG,32,0,0,0,,Who is the acquaintance?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:39.23,*ENG,33,0,0,0,,A Hogwarts Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.30,*ENG,34,0,0,0,,As I understand that he's now Headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:44.51,*ENG,35,0,0,0,,Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.53,*ENG,36,0,0,0,,He put a fake sword in Bellatrix's vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.20,*ENG,37,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.87,*ENG,38,0,0,0,,There are more than a few curious things in the vaults at Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.78,*ENG,39,0,0,0,,And in Madam Lestrange's vault as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:02.25,*ENG,40,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:08.45,*ENG,41,0,0,0,,I need to get into Gringotts. Into one of the vaults.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.34,*ENG,42,0,0,0,,- It is impossible. - Alone, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.61,*ENG,43,0,0,0,,But with you, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.88,*ENG,44,0,0,0,,- Why should I help you? - I have gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.78,*ENG,45,0,0,0,,Lots of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.49,*ENG,46,0,0,0,,I've no interest in gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.77,*ENG,47,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.75,*ENG,48,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:36.15,*ENG,49,0,0,0,,That is my price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.99,*ENG,50,0,0,0,,Are you thinking there's a Horcrux in Bellatrix's vault?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.28,*ENG,51,0,0,0,,Well, she was terrified when she thought we had been in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.42,*ENG,52,0,0,0,,She kept asking you, what else was taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:59.82,*ENG,53,0,0,0,,I bet you anything, there's Horcrux in there. Another piece of his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:03.26,*ENG,54,0,0,0,,Let's find it, kill it, and we are one step closer to killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:04.38,*ENG,55,0,0,0,,And what happens when we find it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:07.44,*ENG,56,0,0,0,,How're we supposed to destroy it, now you're giving the sword to Griphook?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:10.17,*ENG,57,0,0,0,,I'm still working on that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:13.93,*ENG,58,0,0,0,,He's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.12,*ENG,59,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.12,*ENG,60,0,0,0,,Mr. Ollivander
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.12,*ENG,61,0,0,0,,I need to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.16,*ENG,62,0,0,0,,Anything, m'boy. Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:39.59,*ENG,63,0,0,0,,Would you mind identifying this wand? We need to know if it's safe to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:47.63,*ENG,64,0,0,0,,Uhh... Walnut
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:51.02,*ENG,65,0,0,0,,Dragon Heartstring
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.01,*ENG,66,0,0,0,,12 and three quarter inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.60,*ENG,67,0,0,0,,Unyie...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.26,*ENG,68,0,0,0,,Unyielding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:06.52,*ENG,69,0,0,0,,This belonged to Bellatrix Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.06,*ENG,70,0,0,0,,Try this carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.13,*ENG,71,0,0,0,,And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.68,*ENG,72,0,0,0,,Hawthorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.34,*ENG,73,0,0,0,,An unicorn hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.99,*ENG,74,0,0,0,,10 inches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:25.30,*ENG,75,0,0,0,,Reasonably pliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.20,*ENG,76,0,0,0,,This was the wand of Draco Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:35.66,*ENG,77,0,0,0,,Was?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.28,*ENG,78,0,0,0,,Is it not still?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.67,*ENG,79,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps not. If you won it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:46.68,*ENG,80,0,0,0,,I sense its allegiance has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:56.52,*ENG,81,0,0,0,,You talk about wands, as if they have feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.67,*ENG,82,0,0,0,,.......can think!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:07.80,*ENG,83,0,0,0,,The wand chooses the wizard, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:13.53,*ENG,84,0,0,0,,That much has always been clear to those of us who've studied wandlore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:18.24,*ENG,85,0,0,0,,And, what do you know about the Deathly Hallows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.91,*ENG,86,0,0,0,,It is rumored there are three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:36.15,*ENG,87,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand, the Cloak of Invisibility, to hide you from your enemies...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:41.82,*ENG,88,0,0,0,,and the Resurrection Stone, to bring back loved ones from the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:46.88,*ENG,89,0,0,0,,Together, they make one the Master of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:53.72,*ENG,90,0,0,0,,But few, truly believe that such objects exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:55.00,*ENG,91,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.97,*ENG,92,0,0,0,,Do you believe they exist, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.46,*ENG,93,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:07.78,*ENG,94,0,0,0,,I see no reason to put stock into an old wives' tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.87,*ENG,95,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.89,*ENG,96,0,0,0,,You know one exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:18.27,*ENG,97,0,0,0,,You told him about it. You told him about the Elder Wand...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.10,*ENG,98,0,0,0,,and where he could go looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.45,*ENG,99,0,0,0,,He tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:30.93,*ENG,100,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.23,*ENG,101,0,0,0,,....I only conveyed rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.01,*ENG,102,0,0,0,,There's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:42.62,*ENG,103,0,0,0,,There's no telling whether he will find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:47.61,*ENG,104,0,0,0,,He has found it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:55.07,*ENG,105,0,0,0,,We'll let you rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.13,*ENG,106,0,0,0,,He's after you, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:03.68,*ENG,107,0,0,0,,If it's true what you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.78,*ENG,108,0,0,0,,that he has the Elder Wand,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:10.23,*ENG,109,0,0,0,,I'm afraid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.93,*ENG,110,0,0,0,,...you really don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:17.54,*ENG,111,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I'll have to kill him, before he finds me, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.42,*ENG,112,0,0,0,,You're sure that's hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:28.94,*ENG,113,0,0,0,,Positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.37,*ENG,114,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.23,*ENG,115,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.02,*ENG,116,0,0,0,,Hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:45.07,*ENG,117,0,0,0,,You can give that to Hermione to hold. Alright, Griphook?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.85,*ENG,118,0,0,0,,We're relying on you, Griphook.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.95,*ENG,119,0,0,0,,If you get us past the guards into the vault...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.15,*ENG,120,0,0,0,,The sword's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.93,*ENG,121,0,0,0,,Madam Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.12,*ENG,122,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:31.73,*ENG,123,0,0,0,,Good morning? Good morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.93,*ENG,124,0,0,0,,You're Bellatrix Lestrange, not some school girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.47,*ENG,125,0,0,0,,Hey! Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:41.56,*ENG,126,0,0,0,,If she gives us away, we must swear to use that sword to slit our own throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.92,*ENG,127,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.12,*ENG,128,0,0,0,,No, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:46.58,*ENG,129,0,0,0,,I speak stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.53,0:11:50.29,*ENG,130,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:58.34,*ENG,131,0,0,0,,I wish to enter my vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:03.81,*ENG,132,0,0,0,,Identification?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:09.39,*ENG,133,0,0,0,,I hardly think that would be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.87,*ENG,134,0,0,0,,Madam Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:21.33,*ENG,135,0,0,0,,I don't like to be kept waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.21,*ENG,136,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.77,*ENG,137,0,0,0,,They know she's an impostor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.62,*ENG,138,0,0,0,,They'd be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:39.58,*ENG,139,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.04,*ENG,140,0,0,0,,What do we do, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:51.81,*ENG,141,0,0,0,,Madam Lestrange, would you mind presenting your wand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.64,*ENG,142,0,0,0,,And why should I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:59.51,*ENG,143,0,0,0,,It's the bank's policy! I'm sure you understand, given current climate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:03.46,*ENG,144,0,0,0,,No! I most certainly do not understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:07.06,*ENG,145,0,0,0,,I'm afraid, I must insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:14.24,*ENG,146,0,0,0,,Imperio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.12,*ENG,147,0,0,0,,Very well, Madam Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.26,*ENG,148,0,0,0,,If you will follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.21,*ENG,149,0,0,0,,What is that, Griphook?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.88,*ENG,150,0,0,0,,Griphook!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:29.37,*ENG,151,0,0,0,,Aresto Momentum
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.87,*ENG,152,0,0,0,,Well done, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:44.99,*ENG,153,0,0,0,,Oh no, you two're like you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:49.53,*ENG,154,0,0,0,,The Thief's Downfall, washes away all enchantments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.85,*ENG,155,0,0,0,,Can be deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.42,*ENG,156,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.30,*ENG,157,0,0,0,,Just out of interest, is there any other way out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:56.36,*ENG,158,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:02.02,*ENG,159,0,0,0,,What the devil are all you doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:03.69,*ENG,160,0,0,0,,Thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:04.72,*ENG,161,0,0,0,,You gave up the.....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:06.68,*ENG,162,0,0,0,,- Imperio - You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.37,*ENG,163,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.97,*ENG,164,0,0,0,,Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:32.61,*ENG,165,0,0,0,,That's an Ukrainian Ironbelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:33.49,*ENG,166,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:48.16,*ENG,167,0,0,0,,It's been trained to expect pain when it hears the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:49.82,*ENG,168,0,0,0,,That's barbaric!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.16,*ENG,169,0,0,0,,Lumos
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:26.62,*ENG,170,0,0,0,,Blimey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:36.30,*ENG,171,0,0,0,,Accio Horcrux
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.49,*ENG,172,0,0,0,,You seem you're gonna try that one to get over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.42,*ENG,173,0,0,0,,No kind of magic would work in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.79,*ENG,174,0,0,0,,It's in here, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.57,*ENG,175,0,0,0,,Can you feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:15.93,*ENG,176,0,0,0,,That's it! Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:22.85,*ENG,177,0,0,0,,They have added the Gemino curse. Everything you touch will multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.33,*ENG,178,0,0,0,,Give me the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.56,*ENG,179,0,0,0,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.15,*ENG,180,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:13.57,*ENG,181,0,0,0,,- We had deal, Griphook! - The cup for the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:23.87,*ENG,182,0,0,0,,I said I'll get you in, I didn't say anything about getting you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:48.60,*ENG,183,0,0,0,,Griphook! Thieves! Griphook!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.30,*ENG,184,0,0,0,,Hey, thieves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.16,*ENG,185,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.22,*ENG,186,0,0,0,,We've still got Bogrod.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.35,*ENG,187,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.97,*ENG,188,0,0,0,,We can't just stand here, You got any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:13.63,*ENG,189,0,0,0,,You're the brilliant one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:16.13,*ENG,190,0,0,0,,I've got something, but it's mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:17.19,*ENG,191,0,0,0,,Reducto
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:32.05,*ENG,192,0,0,0,,Well, come on, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:35.32,*ENG,193,0,0,0,,Relashio
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:23.88,*ENG,194,0,0,0,,Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:52.39,*ENG,195,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.85,*ENG,196,0,0,0,,Reducto
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:56.00,*ENG,197,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:09.51,*ENG,198,0,0,0,,That was brilliant! Absolutely brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:38.76,*ENG,199,0,0,0,,We're dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.31,*ENG,200,0,0,0,,- I say we jump! - When?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:45.27,*ENG,201,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:41.03,*ENG,202,0,0,0,,He knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:42.44,*ENG,203,0,0,0,,You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:44.91,*ENG,204,0,0,0,,He knows we broke into Gringotts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.16,0:23:47.76,*ENG,205,0,0,0,,He knows what we took, and he knows we're hunting Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:49.96,*ENG,206,0,0,0,,- How is it you know? - I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:53.22,*ENG,207,0,0,0,,You let him in? Harry, you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:54.85,*ENG,208,0,0,0,,Hermione, I can't always help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:56.85,*ENG,209,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I can. I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:58.38,*ENG,210,0,0,0,,Never mind! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:24:00.58,*ENG,211,0,0,0,,Well, he's angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.61,0:24:02.10,*ENG,212,0,0,0,,and scared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:05.59,*ENG,213,0,0,0,,He knows, if we find and destroy all the Horcruxes, we'll be able to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.96,0:24:08.88,*ENG,214,0,0,0,,I reckon he'll stop at nothing to make sure we don't find the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.04,0:24:11.88,*ENG,215,0,0,0,,And there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:13.23,*ENG,216,0,0,0,,One of them is at Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:14.36,*ENG,217,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:16.07,*ENG,218,0,0,0,,You saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.14,*ENG,219,0,0,0,,I saw the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:18.30,*ENG,220,0,0,0,,And Rowena Ravenclaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:19.61,*ENG,221,0,0,0,,It must have something to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.65,0:24:20.75,*ENG,222,0,0,0,,We have to go there, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:21.97,*ENG,223,0,0,0,,Well, we can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:24.63,*ENG,224,0,0,0,,We've got to plan, we've got to figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:27.32,*ENG,225,0,0,0,,Hermione, when have any of our plans ever actually worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.67,*ENG,226,0,0,0,,We plan, we get there, all hell breaks loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.07,0:24:33.51,*ENG,227,0,0,0,,He's right! One problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:36.76,*ENG,228,0,0,0,,Snape's Headmaster now, we can't just move from the front door!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:40.63,*ENG,229,0,0,0,,Well, we'll go to Hogsmeade,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:42.04,*ENG,230,0,0,0,,to Honeydukes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.07,0:24:43.57,*ENG,231,0,0,0,,Take the secret passage in the cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.82,0:24:44.91,*ENG,232,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:46.94,*ENG,233,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:49.74,*ENG,234,0,0,0,,It's like, you know, in the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:52.33,*ENG,235,0,0,0,,I've always been able to follow his thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:54.51,*ENG,236,0,0,0,,And now everything just feels disconnected.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:24:58.03,*ENG,237,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the Horcruxes. Maybe he's growing weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:24:59.10,*ENG,238,0,0,0,,Maybe he's dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:24:59.97,*ENG,239,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.01,0:25:01.64,*ENG,240,0,0,0,,No, it's.. it's more like he's wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:04.05,*ENG,241,0,0,0,,If anything, he feels more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.50,0:25:56.77,*ENG,242,0,0,0,,- Right here. Come on! - Search everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:57.21,*ENG,243,0,0,0,,Go, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:18.10,*ENG,244,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:33.00,*ENG,245,0,0,0,,In here, Potter. Come on, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:47.40,*ENG,246,0,0,0,,Did you look at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.90,0:26:50.86,*ENG,247,0,0,0,,- For a second I thought that was... - I know. Dumbledore!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:08.59,*ENG,248,0,0,0,,Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.05,0:27:12.50,*ENG,249,0,0,0,,I can see you in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.93,0:27:28.77,*ENG,250,0,0,0,,Bloody fools, what were you thinking, coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:31.75,*ENG,251,0,0,0,,Have you any idea how dangerous it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.78,0:27:34.71,*ENG,252,0,0,0,,You're Aberforth, Dumbledore's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.03,0:27:37.85,*ENG,253,0,0,0,,It's you who I've been seeing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.64,0:27:40.02,*ENG,254,0,0,0,,You're the one who sent Dobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:42.64,*ENG,255,0,0,0,,- Why've you left him? - He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:46.02,*ENG,256,0,0,0,,Sorry to hear it. I liked that elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.13,0:27:47.46,*ENG,257,0,0,0,,Who gave that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.49,0:27:48.10,*ENG,258,0,0,0,,The mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:52.17,*ENG,259,0,0,0,,Mundungus Fletcher, 'bout a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.61,*ENG,260,0,0,0,,Dung had no right selling that to you. It belongs to...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:54.53,*ENG,261,0,0,0,,Sirius...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.85,0:27:57.28,*ENG,262,0,0,0,,Albus told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.32,0:28:00.97,*ENG,263,0,0,0,,He also told me you'd likely be hacked off,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:04.08,*ENG,264,0,0,0,,...if you ever found that I had it. But, ask yourself;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.12,0:28:06.51,*ENG,265,0,0,0,,Where would you be if I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.80,0:28:13.08,*ENG,266,0,0,0,,Do you have any others much?From the Order?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:14.94,*ENG,267,0,0,0,,The Order's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.75,0:28:16.88,*ENG,268,0,0,0,,You-Know-Who's won,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.22,0:28:20.21,*ENG,269,0,0,0,,...anyone who says otherwise is killing themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.93,0:28:22.85,*ENG,270,0,0,0,,We need to get into Hogwarts, tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:25.12,*ENG,271,0,0,0,,Dumbledore gave us a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:26.79,*ENG,272,0,0,0,,Did he now...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.64,0:28:29.59,*ENG,273,0,0,0,,Nice job? Easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.25,*ENG,274,0,0,0,,We've been hunting Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:35.35,*ENG,275,0,0,0,,And we think the last one's inside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.39,0:28:36.49,*ENG,276,0,0,0,,But we'll need your help getting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:40.35,*ENG,277,0,0,0,,Which job my brother has given you no, it's a suicide mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.62,*ENG,278,0,0,0,,Do yourself a favor, boy. Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.27,0:28:44.16,*ENG,279,0,0,0,,Live a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:45.79,*ENG,280,0,0,0,,Dumbledore trusted me to see this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:47.93,*ENG,281,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:51.84,*ENG,282,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can believe anything my brother told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.29,*ENG,283,0,0,0,,And in all the time you knew him...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.54,0:28:55.38,*ENG,284,0,0,0,,Did he ever mention my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.95,0:28:58.27,*ENG,285,0,0,0,,Did he ever mentioned hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:02.19,*ENG,286,0,0,0,,- Why should he... - Keep secrets.You tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.63,0:29:06.10,*ENG,287,0,0,0,,- I trusted him. - That's a boy's answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:12.33,*ENG,288,0,0,0,,A boy goes chasing Horcruxes on the word of a man who wouldn't even tell him where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.57,*ENG,289,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.02,0:29:17.61,*ENG,290,0,0,0,,Not just on me, that doesn't matter. To yourself as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.06,0:29:19.65,*ENG,291,0,0,0,,That's what a fool does.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:23.79,*ENG,292,0,0,0,,You don't strike me as a fool, Harry Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:27.60,*ENG,293,0,0,0,,So, I'll ask you again, there must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.79,0:29:33.55,*ENG,294,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in what happened between you and your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.99,0:29:37.11,*ENG,295,0,0,0,,I don't care that you've given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:41.16,*ENG,296,0,0,0,,I trusted the man I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:47.75,*ENG,297,0,0,0,,We need to get into the castle tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:55.35,*ENG,298,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:04.09,*ENG,299,0,0,0,,Where've you sent her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.75,0:30:05.95,*ENG,300,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:08.14,*ENG,301,0,0,0,,Soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:16.76,*ENG,302,0,0,0,,That's your sister, Ariana. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.50,0:30:20.32,*ENG,303,0,0,0,,She died very young, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.33,0:30:27.72,*ENG,304,0,0,0,,My brother sacrificed many things, Mr. Potter.On his journey to find power.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:29.81,*ENG,305,0,0,0,,Including Ariana.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:33.03,*ENG,306,0,0,0,,And she was devoted to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:36.35,*ENG,307,0,0,0,,He gave her everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.50,*ENG,308,0,0,0,,...but time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.68,*ENG,309,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.83,0:30:52.29,*ENG,310,0,0,0,,He did save our lives twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:55.30,*ENG,311,0,0,0,,Kept an eye on us on that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:30:59.52,*ENG,312,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem like someone who's given up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:07.03,*ENG,313,0,0,0,,She's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:09.68,*ENG,314,0,0,0,,What's that with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:19.50,*ENG,315,0,0,0,,Neville!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.53,0:31:20.86,*ENG,316,0,0,0,,- How you look... - Like hell, I reckon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.65,0:31:22.62,*ENG,317,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.98,0:31:24.22,*ENG,318,0,0,0,,Seamus is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.02,0:31:26.10,*ENG,319,0,0,0,,Hey, Ab!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.14,0:31:27.88,*ENG,320,0,0,0,,We've got a couple more coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:31.39,*ENG,321,0,0,0,,Don't remember this on the Marauder's Map.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:33.21,*ENG,322,0,0,0,,That's because it never existed till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.25,0:31:36.48,*ENG,323,0,0,0,,The seven secret passages were sealed off, before the start of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.40,*ENG,324,0,0,0,,This is the only way in or out, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:41.65,*ENG,325,0,0,0,,The grounds are crawled with Death Eaters and Dementors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.75,*ENG,326,0,0,0,,How about Mr.Snape as Headmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.78,0:31:44.84,*ENG,327,0,0,0,,Hardly ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.87,0:31:46.60,*ENG,328,0,0,0,,It's the Carrows who's watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.04,0:31:47.95,*ENG,329,0,0,0,,Carrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:50.55,*ENG,330,0,0,0,,Yeah. Brother and sister. Incharge of discipline.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.59,0:31:52.21,*ENG,331,0,0,0,,They like punishment, the Carrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:53.69,*ENG,332,0,0,0,,They did that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.98,0:31:54.80,*ENG,333,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:58.00,*ENG,334,0,0,0,,Today's Dark Arts lesson was practicing the Cruciatus curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.03,0:31:59.72,*ENG,335,0,0,0,,On first years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:02.55,*ENG,336,0,0,0,,I refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:04.99,*ENG,337,0,0,0,,Hogwarts has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:20.18,*ENG,338,0,0,0,,Let's have a bit of fun, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:27.81,*ENG,339,0,0,0,,Hey, listen up you lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.84,0:32:29.06,*ENG,340,0,0,0,,I've for you a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.34,0:32:30.98,*ENG,341,0,0,0,,No more Aberforth's cook gonna help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.66,0:32:33.11,*ENG,342,0,0,0,,We'll be surprised if we can digest that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:38.17,*ENG,343,0,0,0,,- Oh my! - Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.25,0:32:54.77,*ENG,344,0,0,0,,Get the word out to Remus and the others, that Harry is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:56.55,*ENG,345,0,0,0,,Okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:59.09,*ENG,346,0,0,0,,Let's not kill him before You-Know-Who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.09,0:33:01.21,*ENG,347,0,0,0,,...Do you read? We've a new weather report.Lightning has struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:02.81,*ENG,348,0,0,0,,I repeat: Lightning has struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:04.71,*ENG,349,0,0,0,,What's the fun, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:10.54,*ENG,350,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.34,0:33:13.04,*ENG,351,0,0,0,,There's something we need to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:15.54,*ENG,352,0,0,0,,Something hidden here, in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.12,0:33:17.81,*ENG,353,0,0,0,,And it may help us to defeat You-Know-Who.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:22.07,*ENG,354,0,0,0,,- Alright, what is it? - We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:26.02,*ENG,355,0,0,0,,- Where is it? - We don't know that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.26,0:33:29.25,*ENG,356,0,0,0,,I realize there's not much to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.56,0:33:30.16,*ENG,357,0,0,0,,That's nothing to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.48,0:33:33.49,*ENG,358,0,0,0,,I think it has something to do with Ravenclaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:38.63,*ENG,359,0,0,0,,It'll be small, easily concealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.74,0:33:41.01,*ENG,360,0,0,0,,Anyone, any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.43,0:33:45.66,*ENG,361,0,0,0,,Well, there's Rowena Ravenclaw's lost diadem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:46.90,*ENG,362,0,0,0,,Oh, bloody hell! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.61,0:33:50.14,*ENG,363,0,0,0,,Lost diadem of Ravenclaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.28,0:33:52.43,*ENG,364,0,0,0,,Hasn't anyone heard of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:54.80,*ENG,365,0,0,0,,It's quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:56.79,*ENG,366,0,0,0,,Yes. But, Luna, it's lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.83,0:34:00.59,*ENG,367,0,0,0,,For centuries. There's no person alive today who's seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.42,0:34:03.83,*ENG,368,0,0,0,,Excuse me, can someone tell me what bloody diadem is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:05.00,*ENG,369,0,0,0,,It's a sort of crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:06.48,*ENG,370,0,0,0,,You know, like a tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:11.23,*ENG,371,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.22,0:34:13.65,*ENG,372,0,0,0,,Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:19.88,*ENG,373,0,0,0,,Six months she doesn't see me and it's like I'm a frankie first-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:20.87,*ENG,374,0,0,0,,I'm her brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.19,0:34:23.81,*ENG,375,0,0,0,,- She's got lots of them, but she's got only one Harry. - Shut up, Seamus!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:25.50,*ENG,376,0,0,0,,What is it, Ginny?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.19,0:34:29.57,*ENG,377,0,0,0,,Snape knows... he knows that Harry was spotted in Hogsmeade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:14.16,*ENG,378,0,0,0,,Many of you are surely wondering, why I have summoned you at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.54,0:35:20.05,*ENG,379,0,0,0,,It's come to my attention, that earlier this evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.68,0:35:24.84,*ENG,380,0,0,0,,Harry Potter was sighted in Hogsmeade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.42,0:35:28.43,*ENG,381,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.18,0:35:30.56,*ENG,382,0,0,0,,should anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:37.91,*ENG,383,0,0,0,,student or staff attempt to aid Mr. Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.97,0:35:47.61,*ENG,384,0,0,0,,They will be punished in a manner consistent with the severity of their transcription, further more...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.36,0:35:52.03,*ENG,385,0,0,0,,Any person found to have knowledge of these events...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:57.72,*ENG,386,0,0,0,,who fails to come forward...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.32,0:36:06.73,*ENG,387,0,0,0,,...will be treated as equally guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:11.20,*ENG,388,0,0,0,,Another...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.35,0:36:23.31,*ENG,389,0,0,0,,If anyone in here has any knowledge of Mr. Potter's movements this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:29.13,*ENG,390,0,0,0,,I invite them to step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.58,0:36:35.11,*ENG,391,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:53.92,*ENG,392,0,0,0,,It seems, despite your exhaustive defensive strategies,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.96,0:36:56.62,*ENG,393,0,0,0,,...you still have a bit of security problem, Headmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:02.16,*ENG,394,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's quite extensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:05.80,*ENG,395,0,0,0,,How dare you stand where he stood?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.64,0:37:11.70,*ENG,396,0,0,0,,Tell them how it happened that night?Tell them how you looked him in the eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.73,0:37:14.23,*ENG,397,0,0,0,,A man who trusted you, and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.34,0:37:15.56,*ENG,398,0,0,0,,Tell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.46,0:37:54.49,*ENG,399,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:56.25,*ENG,400,0,0,0,,Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:35.58,*ENG,401,0,0,0,,I know that many of you will want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:41.68,*ENG,402,0,0,0,,Some of you may even think that to fight is wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.72,0:38:44.21,*ENG,403,0,0,0,,But this is folly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:48.62,*ENG,404,0,0,0,,Give me Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.48,0:38:52.91,*ENG,405,0,0,0,,Do this and none shall be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.67,0:38:59.50,*ENG,406,0,0,0,,Give me Harry Potter, and I shall leave Hogwarts untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.16,0:39:07.00,*ENG,407,0,0,0,,Give me Harry Potter, and you will be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.03,0:39:09.63,*ENG,408,0,0,0,,You have one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:24.04,*ENG,409,0,0,0,,What're you waiting for? Someone grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.39,0:39:37.62,*ENG,410,0,0,0,,Students out of bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:41.12,*ENG,411,0,0,0,,- Students in the corridor! - They're supposed to be out of bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:42.72,*ENG,412,0,0,0,,you blithering idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:47.76,*ENG,413,0,0,0,,Sorry ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.80,0:39:49.23,*ENG,414,0,0,0,,As it happens, Mr. Filch...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.27,0:39:50.93,*ENG,415,0,0,0,,Your arrival is most opportune.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.81,0:39:55.48,*ENG,416,0,0,0,,If you would, I would like you please, to lead Miss Parkinson
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:58.48,*ENG,417,0,0,0,,and the rest of Slytherin house, from the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.51,0:40:01.36,*ENG,418,0,0,0,,Exactly where is it I'll be leading 'em to, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.40,0:40:03.01,*ENG,419,0,0,0,,The dungeons would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.78,0:40:11.22,*ENG,420,0,0,0,,I presume you have a reason for returning, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:12.38,*ENG,421,0,0,0,,What is it you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:15.21,*ENG,422,0,0,0,,Time, Professor. As much as you can get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.50,0:40:17.05,*ENG,423,0,0,0,,Do what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:18.60,*ENG,424,0,0,0,,I'll secure the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:21.54,*ENG,425,0,0,0,,Potter...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.99,0:40:25.12,*ENG,426,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:28.45,*ENG,427,0,0,0,,It's good to see you too, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.04,0:40:31.11,*ENG,428,0,0,0,,Hold the fort, Neville.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.87,0:40:44.24,*ENG,429,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.71,0:40:47.78,*ENG,430,0,0,0,,Hermione and I've been thinking, it doesn't matter if we find a Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.81,0:40:48.74,*ENG,431,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.77,0:40:50.17,*ENG,432,0,0,0,,Unless we can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.21,0:40:51.66,*ENG,433,0,0,0,,So, we were thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.66,0:40:53.04,*ENG,434,0,0,0,,Well, Ron was thinking, it was Ron's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.04,0:40:53.90,*ENG,435,0,0,0,,It's completely brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.34,0:40:56.94,*ENG,436,0,0,0,,You destroyed Tom Riddle's diary with a Basilisk's fang, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.04,0:41:00.25,*ENG,437,0,0,0,,Well, me and Hermione did remind where we might find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.25,*ENG,438,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.87,0:41:03.14,*ENG,439,0,0,0,,Okay, but take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:05.21,*ENG,440,0,0,0,,That way, you can find me when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.00,0:41:06.53,*ENG,441,0,0,0,,Where're you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.53,0:41:09.34,*ENG,442,0,0,0,,Ravenclaw common room, Gotta start somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.83,0:41:18.72,*ENG,443,0,0,0,,Harry! Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.36,0:41:20.86,*ENG,444,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight, Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.90,0:41:22.71,*ENG,445,0,0,0,,You're actually giving us permission to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.74,0:41:25.06,*ENG,446,0,0,0,,That is correct, Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.10,0:41:26.81,*ENG,447,0,0,0,,To blow it up! Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:27.53,*ENG,448,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.14,0:41:29.72,*ENG,449,0,0,0,,Wicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.75,0:41:31.35,*ENG,450,0,0,0,,But how on earth are we gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.33,0:41:34.26,*ENG,451,0,0,0,,Why don't you confer with Mr. Finnigan?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.30,0:41:38.42,*ENG,452,0,0,0,,As I recall, he has a particular proclivity for pyro-technics.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.46,0:41:39.24,*ENG,453,0,0,0,,I can bring it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:40.86,*ENG,454,0,0,0,,That's the spirit! Away, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.04,0:41:46.29,*ENG,455,0,0,0,,You do realize, of course, we can't keep out You-Know-Who indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.33,0:41:48.41,*ENG,456,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean we can't delay him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.41,0:41:54.48,*ENG,457,0,0,0,,And his name is Voldemort. Filius, you might as well use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.22,0:41:57.31,*ENG,458,0,0,0,,He's come to try to kill you, either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.32,0:42:03.63,*ENG,459,0,0,0,,Piertotum Locomotor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.71,0:42:21.08,*ENG,460,0,0,0,,Hogwarts is threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:26.52,*ENG,461,0,0,0,,Man the boundaries! Protect us. Do your duty...to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.24,0:42:33.09,*ENG,462,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to use that spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:46.68,*ENG,463,0,0,0,,Protego MaximaFianto Duri
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.68,0:42:50.50,*ENG,464,0,0,0,,Repello InimigotumProtego Maxima
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.38,0:42:57.19,*ENG,465,0,0,0,,Repello....Fianto DuriRepello Inimigotum
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.50,0:43:26.85,*ENG,466,0,0,0,,Harry, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:28.40,*ENG,467,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.64,0:43:31.02,*ENG,468,0,0,0,,- I'm a bit pre-occupied at the moment, Luna. - You don't know anything where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.02,0:43:32.54,*ENG,469,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.56,0:43:33.51,*ENG,470,0,0,0,,Look, we'll talk later, okay, Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.51,0:43:35.60,*ENG,471,0,0,0,,- Harry? - Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.64,0:43:37.80,*ENG,472,0,0,0,,Harry Potter, you listen to me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.24,0:43:43.17,*ENG,473,0,0,0,,Do you remember what Cho said about Rowena Ravenclaw's diadem?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.20,0:43:45.36,*ENG,474,0,0,0,,There is not a person alive who's seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.01,0:43:48.26,*ENG,475,0,0,0,,It's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:50.30,*ENG,476,0,0,0,,We have to talk to someone who's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.78,0:44:03.31,*ENG,477,0,0,0,,It's very impressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.39,0:44:22.77,*ENG,478,0,0,0,,If you've to find her, you'll find her down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.83,0:44:24.40,*ENG,479,0,0,0,,- Aren't you coming? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:26.62,*ENG,480,0,0,0,,I think it's best if you two talk alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.64,0:44:28.05,*ENG,481,0,0,0,,She's very shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.26,0:44:57.17,*ENG,482,0,0,0,,You're the Grey Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.22,0:44:59.69,*ENG,483,0,0,0,,The ghost of Ravenclaw tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.72,0:45:01.96,*ENG,484,0,0,0,,I do not answer to that name!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.00,0:45:03.83,*ENG,485,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:05.14,*ENG,486,0,0,0,,It's Helena, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.17,0:45:08.30,*ENG,487,0,0,0,,Helena Ravenclaw, Rowena's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.39,0:45:11.07,*ENG,488,0,0,0,,Are you a friend of Luna's?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.11,0:45:12.18,*ENG,489,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:15.09,*ENG,490,0,0,0,,And she thought you might be able to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.81,0:45:19.90,*ENG,491,0,0,0,,You seek my mother's diadem?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:23.13,*ENG,492,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:25.72,*ENG,493,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.16,0:45:28.80,*ENG,494,0,0,0,,Luna is kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.84,0:45:31.18,*ENG,495,0,0,0,,Unlike so many of the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.23,0:45:35.57,*ENG,496,0,0,0,,But she was wrong, I cannot help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.00,0:45:42.00,*ENG,497,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.54,0:45:45.62,*ENG,498,0,0,0,,I want to destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:25.70,*ENG,499,0,0,0,,They never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.43,0:46:29.02,*ENG,500,0,0,0,,Such a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.81,0:46:32.54,*ENG,501,0,0,0,,But, my Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.37,0:46:34.83,*ENG,502,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.72,0:46:44.68,*ENG,503,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.56,0:47:09.35,*ENG,504,0,0,0,,I thought you want to do it. Isn't it, Helena?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:13.83,*ENG,505,0,0,0,,You want to destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.25,0:47:16.71,*ENG,506,0,0,0,,Another swore to destroy it, many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.61,0:47:20.07,*ENG,507,0,0,0,,A strange boy with a strange name.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.11,0:47:21.21,*ENG,508,0,0,0,,Tom Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:22.37,*ENG,509,0,0,0,,But he lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.49,0:47:24.39,*ENG,510,0,0,0,,He's lied to many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.65,0:47:27.92,*ENG,511,0,0,0,,I know what he's done! I know who he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:31.21,*ENG,512,0,0,0,,He defiled it, with dark magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.97,0:47:47.30,*ENG,513,0,0,0,,I can destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.34,0:47:49.37,*ENG,514,0,0,0,,Once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.76,0:47:54.21,*ENG,515,0,0,0,,But only if you tell me where he hid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:59.93,*ENG,516,0,0,0,,You do know, where he hid it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.63,0:48:01.97,*ENG,517,0,0,0,,Don't you, Helena?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.07,0:48:05.45,*ENG,518,0,0,0,,You just have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.85,0:48:09.32,*ENG,519,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.21,0:48:23.20,*ENG,520,0,0,0,,Strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.43,0:48:28.66,*ENG,521,0,0,0,,You remind me of him a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.93,0:48:34.24,*ENG,522,0,0,0,,It's here, in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.15,0:48:36.72,*ENG,523,0,0,0,,In the place where everything is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.29,0:48:40.54,*ENG,524,0,0,0,,If you have to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.57,0:48:42.17,*ENG,525,0,0,0,,....you will never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.06,0:48:45.43,*ENG,526,0,0,0,,If you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.46,0:48:46.67,*ENG,527,0,0,0,,...you need only ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.98,0:48:50.49,*ENG,528,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.62,0:49:06.77,*ENG,529,0,0,0,,Tell Professor McGonagall. Remus and I will handle this side of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.63,0:49:10.13,*ENG,530,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.05,0:49:16.95,*ENG,531,0,0,0,,Hey Dean, on second thoughts, tell Professor McGonagall
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.05,0:49:19.95,*ENG,532,0,0,0,,we might need one or two more wands this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:25.04,*ENG,533,0,0,0,,It is the quality of one's convictions that determine his success..
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.07,0:49:26.83,*ENG,534,0,0,0,,...not the number of followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.74,0:49:29.18,*ENG,535,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.93,0:49:30.99,*ENG,536,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:37.47,*ENG,537,0,0,0,,You okay, Freddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:39.36,*ENG,538,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.42,0:49:42.46,*ENG,539,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.13,0:50:01.81,*ENG,540,0,0,0,,Harry talks in his sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.85,0:50:03.05,*ENG,541,0,0,0,,Do you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.84,0:50:06.25,*ENG,542,0,0,0,,No, of course, not!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.09,0:50:57.50,*ENG,543,0,0,0,,Yeah? You and whose army?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:19.04,*ENG,544,0,0,0,,You do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.04,0:51:20.72,*ENG,545,0,0,0,,- I can't. - Yes, you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.21,0:54:21.26,*ENG,546,0,0,0,,Neville!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.21,0:54:39.75,*ENG,547,0,0,0,,That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.95,0:55:27.79,*ENG,548,0,0,0,,Get inside! This way! Take cover! Take cover
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.85,0:55:56.98,*ENG,549,0,0,0,,Ginny, Neville! You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.98,0:55:58.20,*ENG,550,0,0,0,,Never better!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.20,0:55:59.86,*ENG,551,0,0,0,,I feel like I can spit fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.21,0:56:01.50,*ENG,552,0,0,0,,Have you seen Luna up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:02.31,*ENG,553,0,0,0,,Luna?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:04.81,*ENG,554,0,0,0,,I'm mad for her. I think it about time I told her
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:07.97,*ENG,555,0,0,0,,since wel probably both be dead by dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.58,0:56:12.61,*ENG,556,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.71,0:56:43.41,*ENG,557,0,0,0,,Bloody hell! We'll never find him on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.45,0:56:45.21,*ENG,558,0,0,0,,Here he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.21,0:56:46.87,*ENG,559,0,0,0,,- Just now... - Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.21,0:56:48.14,*ENG,560,0,0,0,,He just vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.71,0:56:50.04,*ENG,561,0,0,0,,I just now I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.54,0:56:55.29,*ENG,562,0,0,0,,Maybe he's gone to the Room of Requirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.51,0:56:56.98,*ENG,563,0,0,0,,It doesn't show up on the map, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.98,0:56:58.37,*ENG,564,0,0,0,,You said that last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.55,0:57:01.00,*ENG,565,0,0,0,,That's right, I....I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.81,0:57:02.61,*ENG,566,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.26,0:57:05.44,*ENG,567,0,0,0,,Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.37,0:57:12.90,*ENG,568,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.16,0:59:06.23,*ENG,569,0,0,0,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.63,0:59:08.91,*ENG,570,0,0,0,,What brings you here, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.35,0:59:11.52,*ENG,571,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.83,0:59:14.05,*ENG,572,0,0,0,,You have something of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.92,0:59:17.05,*ENG,573,0,0,0,,I'd like it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.08,0:59:18.57,*ENG,574,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the one you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.57,0:59:19.74,*ENG,575,0,0,0,,It's my mother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.02,0:59:21.20,*ENG,576,0,0,0,,It's powerful, but it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.11,0:59:23.02,*ENG,577,0,0,0,,..not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.21,0:59:26.88,*ENG,578,0,0,0,,Doesn't quite understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.43,0:59:29.40,*ENG,579,0,0,0,,You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.04,0:59:31.42,*ENG,580,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.86,0:59:35.01,*ENG,581,0,0,0,,Bellatrix?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.48,0:59:39.77,*ENG,582,0,0,0,,You knew it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.74,0:59:42.55,*ENG,583,0,0,0,,You didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.05,0:59:43.94,*ENG,584,0,0,0,,Come on, Draco!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.73,0:59:45.94,*ENG,585,0,0,0,,Don't be a prat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.52,0:59:47.21,*ENG,586,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.87,0:59:49.76,*ENG,587,0,0,0,,Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:52.29,*ENG,588,0,0,0,,Expelliarmus
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.86,0:59:54.23,*ENG,589,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.23,0:59:55.13,*ENG,590,0,0,0,,Stupefy
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.67,1:00:01.89,*ENG,591,0,0,0,,This is my girlfriend, you bloody gits!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.09,1:00:25.18,*ENG,592,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.83,1:00:42.23,*ENG,593,0,0,0,,They've set the bloody place on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.81,1:01:51.64,*ENG,594,0,0,0,,Come on! This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.37,1:02:00.99,*ENG,595,0,0,0,,We can't leave them!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.81,1:02:02.81,*ENG,596,0,0,0,,He's joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:15.26,*ENG,597,0,0,0,,If we die for them, Harry, I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.32,1:02:38.54,*ENG,598,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.18,1:03:27.31,*ENG,599,0,0,0,,My Lord?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.81,1:03:29.54,*ENG,600,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.78,1:03:40.92,*ENG,601,0,0,0,,Come Nagini, I need to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.03,1:03:54.32,*ENG,602,0,0,0,,It's the snake....
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.26,1:03:56.35,*ENG,603,0,0,0,,....and she's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.67,1:03:58.38,*ENG,604,0,0,0,,It's the last Horcrux.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.03,1:04:06.60,*ENG,605,0,0,0,,Look inside him, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.01,1:04:11.18,*ENG,606,0,0,0,,Find out where he is, if you find him, we can find the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:13.25,*ENG,607,0,0,0,,And we can end this!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.19,1:04:42.60,*ENG,608,0,0,0,,My Lord...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.73,1:04:46.39,*ENG,609,0,0,0,,Might it be less...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.97,1:04:51.49,*ENG,610,0,0,0,,I should not be more prudent to call off this attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.79,1:04:56.09,*ENG,611,0,0,0,,Simply seek the boy. Yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.09,1:04:58.84,*ENG,612,0,0,0,,I do not need to seek the boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.88,1:05:03.75,*ENG,613,0,0,0,,....before the night is out, he will come to me! Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.35,1:05:06.54,*ENG,614,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.87,1:05:10.89,*ENG,615,0,0,0,,How can you live with yourself, Lucius?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:12.96,*ENG,616,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.74,1:05:17.53,*ENG,617,0,0,0,,Go and find Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.98,1:05:20.14,*ENG,618,0,0,0,,Bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.39,1:05:30.49,*ENG,619,0,0,0,,I know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.51,1:05:42.00,*ENG,620,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.82,1:06:31.38,*ENG,621,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.14,1:07:21.19,*ENG,622,0,0,0,,You have performed extra-ordinary magic with this wand, My Lord,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.26,1:07:23.34,*ENG,623,0,0,0,,...in the last few hours alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.23,1:07:24.81,*ENG,624,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.76,1:07:33.14,*ENG,625,0,0,0,,No! I am extra-ordinary. But the wand resists me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.17,1:07:39.17,*ENG,626,0,0,0,,There is no wand more powerful. Ollivander himself has said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.21,1:07:45.25,*ENG,627,0,0,0,,Tonight, when the boy comes. It will not fail you, I am sure of it...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.38,1:07:53.53,*ENG,628,0,0,0,,It answers to you, and you only.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.44,*ENG,629,0,0,0,,Does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.63,1:08:00.60,*ENG,630,0,0,0,,My Lord?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.33,1:08:05.78,*ENG,631,0,0,0,,The wand, does it truly answer to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:10.39,*ENG,632,0,0,0,,You're a clever man, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.74,1:08:12.12,*ENG,633,0,0,0,,Surely you must know...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.84,1:08:19.75,*ENG,634,0,0,0,,- Where does its true loyalty lie? - With you...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.82,1:08:23.17,*ENG,635,0,0,0,,Of course, My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.21,1:08:30.72,*ENG,636,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand cannot serve me properly, because I am not its true master.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.26,1:08:36.77,*ENG,637,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand belongs to the wizard who killed its last owner.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.65,1:08:46.63,*ENG,638,0,0,0,,You killed Dumbledore, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.12,1:08:52.67,*ENG,639,0,0,0,,While you live, the Elder Wand cannot truly be mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.90,1:08:58.47,*ENG,640,0,0,0,,You've been a good and faithful servant, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.09,1:09:03.72,*ENG,641,0,0,0,,But only I can live forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.15,1:09:09.17,*ENG,642,0,0,0,,My Lord...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.84,1:09:16.87,*ENG,643,0,0,0,,Nagini, kill!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.31,1:10:24.98,*ENG,644,0,0,0,,Take it... Take it up, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:28.61,*ENG,645,0,0,0,,Give me something! Quickly, a flask. Anything!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.41,1:10:49.72,*ENG,646,0,0,0,,Take them to the Pensieve.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.97,1:10:54.33,*ENG,647,0,0,0,,Look at me...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.07,1:11:01.86,*ENG,648,0,0,0,,You really have your mother's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.47,1:11:42.51,*ENG,649,0,0,0,,You've fought valiantly, but in vain...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.91,1:11:55.56,*ENG,650,0,0,0,,I do not wish this. Every drop of magical blood spilled is a terrible waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:11:58.91,*ENG,651,0,0,0,,I, therefore command my forces to retreat...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.37,1:12:05.44,*ENG,652,0,0,0,,In their absence, dispose your dead with dignity,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.97,1:12:12.01,*ENG,653,0,0,0,,Harry Potter, I now speak directly to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.66,1:12:20.63,*ENG,654,0,0,0,,On this night, you have allowed your friends to die for you, rather than face me yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.03,1:12:27.36,*ENG,655,0,0,0,,There is no greater dishonor. Join me in the Forbidden Forrest...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.36,1:12:29.82,*ENG,656,0,0,0,,...and confront your fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.93,1:12:36.38,*ENG,657,0,0,0,,If you do not do this, I shall kill every last man,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.93,1:12:44.38,*ENG,658,0,0,0,,woman and child who tries to conceal you from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.32,1:13:05.75,*ENG,659,0,0,0,,Where's everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.11,1:13:32.50,*ENG,660,0,0,0,,Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.18,1:13:41.12,*ENG,661,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Don't be sad on it,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.34,1:13:42.84,*ENG,662,0,0,0,,she's passed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:46.13,*ENG,663,0,0,0,,There, she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.55,1:16:00.90,*ENG,664,0,0,0,,Freak! Come here! I'm gonna tell mommy! You're freak!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.93,1:16:02.83,*ENG,665,0,0,0,,You're freak, Lily!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.86,1:16:04.79,*ENG,666,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.82,1:16:29.53,*ENG,667,0,0,0,,She's jealous. She's ordinary and you're special.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.86,1:16:31.14,*ENG,668,0,0,0,,That's not true, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.45,1:16:56.54,*ENG,669,0,0,0,,Gryffindor!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.29,1:17:06.60,*ENG,670,0,0,0,,- Hi, I'm James. - Hi, I'm Lily.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.34,1:17:15.39,*ENG,671,0,0,0,,Just like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.46,1:17:17.96,*ENG,672,0,0,0,,Don't say a word against my father!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.59,1:17:30.41,*ENG,673,0,0,0,,Masters shall be reunited once more!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.63,1:17:33.23,*ENG,674,0,0,0,,Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.35,1:17:36.18,*ENG,675,0,0,0,,No, don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:38.77,*ENG,676,0,0,0,,The prophecy did not refer to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.57,1:17:42.60,*ENG,677,0,0,0,,It spoke about a boy born at the end of the July.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.98,1:17:44.81,*ENG,678,0,0,0,,Yes, but he thinks it's her son!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.84,1:17:48.12,*ENG,679,0,0,0,,He intends to hunt them down and to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.69,1:17:53.29,*ENG,680,0,0,0,,Hide him... hide them all. I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.32,1:17:56.70,*ENG,681,0,0,0,,What would you give me in exchange, Severus?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:18:00.04,*ENG,682,0,0,0,,- Anything. - Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.05,1:18:02.89,*ENG,683,0,0,0,,Harry, you were so loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.93,1:18:07.48,*ENG,684,0,0,0,,So loved! Harry, mama loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.03,1:18:10.50,*ENG,685,0,0,0,,Dadda loves you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.36,1:18:13.87,*ENG,686,0,0,0,,Harry, be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.69,1:18:17.93,*ENG,687,0,0,0,,- Be strong. - Avada Kedavra!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.23,1:18:26.11,*ENG,688,0,0,0,,You said you would keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.40,1:18:27.79,*ENG,689,0,0,0,,Lily and James...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.83,1:18:30.67,*ENG,690,0,0,0,,..put their faith in the wrong person, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.70,1:18:32.23,*ENG,691,0,0,0,,Rather like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.38,1:18:36.46,*ENG,692,0,0,0,,The boy survives.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.99,1:18:39.28,*ENG,693,0,0,0,,He doesn't need protection, the Dark Lord has gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.31,1:18:41.11,*ENG,694,0,0,0,,The Dark Lord will return.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.52,1:18:44.75,*ENG,695,0,0,0,,And when he does, the boy will be in terrible danger!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.80,1:18:48.27,*ENG,696,0,0,0,,He has her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.68,1:18:55.26,*ENG,697,0,0,0,,If you truly loved her...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.49,1:19:02.01,*ENG,698,0,0,0,,No one, can know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.51,1:19:05.02,*ENG,699,0,0,0,,I shall never reveal the best of you, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.06,1:19:06.26,*ENG,700,0,0,0,,Your word?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.29,1:19:09.26,*ENG,701,0,0,0,,Can you risk your life every day to protect the boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.26,1:19:13.22,*ENG,702,0,0,0,,He possesses no measurable talent, his arrogance rivals even that of his father
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.26,1:19:15.72,*ENG,703,0,0,0,,and he seems to relish in his fame
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.72,1:19:17.38,*ENG,704,0,0,0,,Don't say a word against my father!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.90,1:19:21.85,*ENG,705,0,0,0,,James Potter, lazy, arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.52,1:19:25.61,*ENG,706,0,0,0,,- My father was a great man! - Your father was a swine!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.33,1:19:32.81,*ENG,707,0,0,0,,Drink it, it will contain the curse to your hand, for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:36.00,*ENG,708,0,0,0,,- It will spread, Albus. - How a long?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.34,1:19:39.78,*ENG,709,0,0,0,,Maybe a year.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.92,1:19:44.33,*ENG,710,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.78,1:19:49.54,*ENG,711,0,0,0,,We both know Lord Voldemort has ordered the Malfoy boy to murder me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.52,1:19:58.01,*ENG,712,0,0,0,,But should he fail, I should presume the Dark Lord will turn to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.22,1:20:04.35,*ENG,713,0,0,0,,You must be the one to kill me, Severus.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.46,1:20:07.31,*ENG,714,0,0,0,,It is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.52,1:20:12.99,*ENG,715,0,0,0,,Only then, will the Dark Lord trust you completely.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.00,1:20:23.04,*ENG,716,0,0,0,,It will come a time, when Harry Potter,must be told something.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.55,1:20:30.55,*ENG,717,0,0,0,,But you must wait, until Voldemort is at his most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.59,1:20:32.46,*ENG,718,0,0,0,,Must be told what?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.40,1:20:38.47,*ENG,719,0,0,0,,On the night, Lord Voldemort went to Godric's Hollow to kill Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.42,1:20:42.91,*ENG,720,0,0,0,,And Lily Potter cast herself between them...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.74,1:20:45.73,*ENG,721,0,0,0,,...the curse rebounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.81,1:20:50.77,*ENG,722,0,0,0,,When that happens, a part of Voldemort's soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.80,1:20:55.31,*ENG,723,0,0,0,,...latched itself onto the only living thing it could find...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.22,1:20:58.05,*ENG,724,0,0,0,,...Harry himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.00,1:21:02.95,*ENG,725,0,0,0,,There's a reason Harry can speak with snakes...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.99,1:21:07.06,*ENG,726,0,0,0,,There's a reason he can look into Lord Voldemort's mind...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.20,1:21:15.36,*ENG,727,0,0,0,,A part of Voldemort lives inside him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.79,1:21:23.78,*ENG,728,0,0,0,,So, when the time comes...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.68,1:21:27.86,*ENG,729,0,0,0,,...the boy must die?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.12,1:21:33.84,*ENG,730,0,0,0,,Yes... yes. He must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.84,1:21:56.45,*ENG,731,0,0,0,,You've kept him alive, so he can die at the proper moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.78,1:22:04.10,*ENG,732,0,0,0,,You've been raising him like a pig for slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.14,1:22:08.81,*ENG,733,0,0,0,,Don't tell me now, that you've grown to care for the boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.89,1:22:15.93,*ENG,734,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.39,1:22:28.96,*ENG,735,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.33,1:22:34.15,*ENG,736,0,0,0,,After all this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.21,1:22:39.83,*ENG,737,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.68,1:22:47.56,*ENG,738,0,0,0,,So, when the time comes...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.00,1:22:50.88,*ENG,739,0,0,0,,...the boy must die?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.82,1:22:53.04,*ENG,740,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:57.64,*ENG,741,0,0,0,,He must die. And Voldemort himself must do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:00.99,*ENG,742,0,0,0,,That is essential.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.91,1:24:08.29,*ENG,743,0,0,0,,- Where've you been? - I thought you went to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.65,1:24:09.59,*ENG,744,0,0,0,,I'm going there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.19,1:24:13.03,*ENG,745,0,0,0,,Are you mad? No...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.16,1:24:16.04,*ENG,746,0,0,0,,You can't give yourself up to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.11,1:24:21.49,*ENG,747,0,0,0,,What is it, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:25.30,*ENG,748,0,0,0,,What is it you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.16,1:24:30.41,*ENG,749,0,0,0,,There's a reason I can hear them.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.74,1:24:33.20,*ENG,750,0,0,0,,The Horcruxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.40,1:24:37.20,*ENG,751,0,0,0,,I think I've known for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.16,1:24:41.15,*ENG,752,0,0,0,,And I think you have, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.52,1:24:47.32,*ENG,753,0,0,0,,- I'll go with you. - No, kill the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.19,1:24:50.54,*ENG,754,0,0,0,,Kill the snake, and then it's just him!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.18,1:26:06.67,*ENG,755,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.57,1:26:12.25,*ENG,756,0,0,0,,I'm ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.74,1:26:55.95,*ENG,757,0,0,0,,Resurrection Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.87,1:27:29.38,*ENG,758,0,0,0,,You've been so brave, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.37,1:27:37.32,*ENG,759,0,0,0,,Why are you here? All of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.08,1:27:41.90,*ENG,760,0,0,0,,We never left.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.96,1:27:52.48,*ENG,761,0,0,0,,Does...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.59,1:27:54.89,*ENG,762,0,0,0,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.61,1:27:57.09,*ENG,763,0,0,0,,Dying?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.65,1:28:00.77,*ENG,764,0,0,0,,Quicker than falling asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:06.58,*ENG,765,0,0,0,,You're nearly there, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.36,1:28:08.16,*ENG,766,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.95,1:28:11.29,*ENG,767,0,0,0,,I never wanted any of you to die for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.78,1:28:15.23,*ENG,768,0,0,0,,And, Remus, your son?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.65,1:28:18.14,*ENG,769,0,0,0,,Others will tell him what his mother and father died for.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.16,1:28:22.47,*ENG,770,0,0,0,,One day, he'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.24,1:28:36.84,*ENG,771,0,0,0,,You'll stay with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.44,1:28:39.88,*ENG,772,0,0,0,,Until the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.92,1:28:42.62,*ENG,773,0,0,0,,And he won't be able to see you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.19,1:28:44.61,*ENG,774,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.01,1:28:48.31,*ENG,775,0,0,0,,We're here, you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:05.14,*ENG,776,0,0,0,,Stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.05,1:29:08.99,*ENG,777,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.05,1:29:27.28,*ENG,778,0,0,0,,No sign of him, My Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.42,1:29:45.53,*ENG,779,0,0,0,,I thought he would come.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.68,1:30:29.51,*ENG,780,0,0,0,,Harry, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.55,1:30:32.09,*ENG,781,0,0,0,,- What're yeh doin' here? - Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.90,1:30:45.54,*ENG,782,0,0,0,,Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.81,1:30:51.06,*ENG,783,0,0,0,,...The Boy Who Lived...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.64,1:30:57.86,*ENG,784,0,0,0,,...come to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.03,1:31:19.08,*ENG,785,0,0,0,,Avada Kedavra
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.10,1:32:15.98,*ENG,786,0,0,0,,You can't help...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.37,1:32:20.33,*ENG,787,0,0,0,,Harry, you wonderful boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.79,1:32:24.20,*ENG,788,0,0,0,,You brave, brave man!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.55,1:32:29.10,*ENG,789,0,0,0,,Let us walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.96,1:32:38.68,*ENG,790,0,0,0,,Professor, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.94,1:32:44.21,*ENG,791,0,0,0,,Something beyond either of our help.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.46,1:32:50.20,*ENG,792,0,0,0,,A part of Voldemort sent here to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.27,1:32:52.92,*ENG,793,0,0,0,,And exactly where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.93,1:32:55.60,*ENG,794,0,0,0,,I was going to ask you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.63,1:32:57.56,*ENG,795,0,0,0,,Where would you say that we are?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.60,1:33:01.37,*ENG,796,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like King's Cross station.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.86,1:33:04.64,*ENG,797,0,0,0,,Only cleaner...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.67,1:33:06.66,*ENG,798,0,0,0,,....and without all the trains.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.10,1:33:10.24,*ENG,799,0,0,0,,King's Cross, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.22,1:33:14.07,*ENG,800,0,0,0,,This is, as they say, "your" party.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.01,1:33:18.70,*ENG,801,0,0,0,,I expect you now realize that you and Voldemort...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.74,1:33:21.81,*ENG,802,0,0,0,,...have been connected by something other than fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.85,1:33:25.05,*ENG,803,0,0,0,,Since that night in Godric's Hollow, all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.08,1:33:26.71,*ENG,804,0,0,0,,So it's true then, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.75,1:33:29.29,*ENG,805,0,0,0,,A part of him lives within me, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.41,1:33:31.48,*ENG,806,0,0,0,,Did.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.84,1:33:35.74,*ENG,807,0,0,0,,It's been just destroyed many moments ago by none other than Voldemort himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.68,1:33:41.50,*ENG,808,0,0,0,,You, were the Horcrux he never meant to make, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.70,1:33:58.45,*ENG,809,0,0,0,,- I have to go back, haven't I? - Oh, that's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.49,1:34:01.30,*ENG,810,0,0,0,,- I've a choice? - Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.43,1:34:04.29,*ENG,811,0,0,0,,We're in King's Cross, you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.26,1:34:10.84,*ENG,812,0,0,0,,I think if you so decide, you'll be able to board a train.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.43,1:34:13.87,*ENG,813,0,0,0,,And where would it take me?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.83,1:34:16.54,*ENG,814,0,0,0,,On.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.67,1:34:36.96,*ENG,815,0,0,0,,Voldemort has the Elder Wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.79,1:34:40.58,*ENG,816,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.96,1:34:43.29,*ENG,817,0,0,0,,- And the snake's still alive? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.40,1:34:46.23,*ENG,818,0,0,0,,And I've nothing to kill it with?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.22,1:34:51.31,*ENG,819,0,0,0,,Help will always be given at Hogwarts, Harry.To those who ask for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.75,1:34:56.65,*ENG,820,0,0,0,,I've always pride of myself on my ability to turn a phrase.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.62,*ENG,821,0,0,0,,Words are, in my not so humble opinion...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.65,1:35:03.98,*ENG,822,0,0,0,,..are most inexhaustible source of magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.07,1:35:08.87,*ENG,823,0,0,0,,Capable of inflicting injury and remedies.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.33,1:35:11.40,*ENG,824,0,0,0,,But I would in this case...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.20,1:35:14.62,*ENG,825,0,0,0,,...amend my original statement to this:
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.26,1:35:23.45,*ENG,826,0,0,0,,Help, will always be given at Hogwarts,To those who deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.62,1:35:32.81,*ENG,827,0,0,0,,Do not pity the dead, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.59,1:35:34.80,*ENG,828,0,0,0,,Pity the living.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.18,1:35:37.18,*ENG,829,0,0,0,,And above all...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.01,1:35:40.38,*ENG,830,0,0,0,,....all those who live without love.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.80,1:35:44.26,*ENG,831,0,0,0,,Professor, my mother's Patronus...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.83,1:35:47.06,*ENG,832,0,0,0,,...was a doe, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.58,1:35:50.45,*ENG,833,0,0,0,,As the same as Professor Snape's.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.95,1:35:53.88,*ENG,834,0,0,0,,It's curious, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.49,1:35:56.34,*ENG,835,0,0,0,,Actually, if I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.37,1:35:58.33,*ENG,836,0,0,0,,...it doesn't seem curious at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.04,1:36:02.57,*ENG,837,0,0,0,,I'll be going now, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.76,1:36:05.53,*ENG,838,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.22,1:36:11.13,*ENG,839,0,0,0,,Is this all real?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.34,1:36:13.93,*ENG,840,0,0,0,,Or is it just happening inside my head?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.42,1:36:17.10,*ENG,841,0,0,0,,Of course it's happening inside your head, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.27,1:36:20.96,*ENG,842,0,0,0,,Why should that mean, that it's not real?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.42,1:36:29.21,*ENG,843,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.24,1:36:30.39,*ENG,844,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.44,1:36:36.42,*ENG,845,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.80,1:36:43.00,*ENG,846,0,0,0,,My Lord, My Lord... Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.60,1:36:45.59,*ENG,847,0,0,0,,I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.91,1:37:00.07,*ENG,848,0,0,0,,The boy... Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.83,1:37:16.37,*ENG,849,0,0,0,,Is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.43,1:37:18.78,*ENG,850,0,0,0,,Draco, is he alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.03,1:37:47.71,*ENG,851,0,0,0,,Dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.61,1:39:17.03,*ENG,852,0,0,0,,Who is that? Hagrid's carrying?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.69,1:39:19.09,*ENG,853,0,0,0,,Neville, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.17,1:39:21.91,*ENG,854,0,0,0,,Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:26.80,*ENG,855,0,0,0,,- ...is dead! - No!No!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.80,1:39:28.42,*ENG,856,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.56,1:39:34.71,*ENG,857,0,0,0,,Stupid girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.03,1:39:38.86,*ENG,858,0,0,0,,Harry Potter...is dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.20,1:39:41.06,*ENG,859,0,0,0,,From this day forth...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.15,1:39:45.81,*ENG,860,0,0,0,,...you'll put your faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.02,1:39:58.22,*ENG,861,0,0,0,,Harry Potter is dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.29,1:40:06.20,*ENG,862,0,0,0,,And now it's the time to declare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.28,1:40:14.95,*ENG,863,0,0,0,,Come forward and join us...or die!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.48,1:40:21.07,*ENG,864,0,0,0,,Draco!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.89,1:40:27.65,*ENG,865,0,0,0,,Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.69,1:40:32.61,*ENG,866,0,0,0,,Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.35,1:40:37.32,*ENG,867,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.41,1:40:52.81,*ENG,868,0,0,0,,Well done, Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.53,1:40:54.68,*ENG,869,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.03,1:41:20.64,*ENG,870,0,0,0,,Well, I must say I'd hoped for better.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.16,1:41:27.19,*ENG,871,0,0,0,,And who might you be, young man?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.05,1:41:30.17,*ENG,872,0,0,0,,Neville Longbottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.66,1:41:40.66,*ENG,873,0,0,0,,Well, Neville, I'm sure we can find a place for you in our rank.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.66,1:41:42.61,*ENG,874,0,0,0,,I'd like to say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.81,1:41:53.86,*ENG,875,0,0,0,,Well, Neville, I'm sure we'd all be fascinated to hear what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.86,1:42:00.14,*ENG,876,0,0,0,,- Doesn't matter that Harry is gone. - Stand down, Neville!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.14,1:42:01.88,*ENG,877,0,0,0,,People die everyday!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.47,1:42:08.62,*ENG,878,0,0,0,,Friends, family.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.63,1:42:12.12,*ENG,879,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.74,1:42:15.68,*ENG,880,0,0,0,,We lost Harry tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.64,1:42:18.87,*ENG,881,0,0,0,,He's still with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.17,1:42:21.33,*ENG,882,0,0,0,,In here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.02,1:42:27.14,*ENG,883,0,0,0,,So as Fred, Remus...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.56,1:42:30.16,*ENG,884,0,0,0,,Tonks...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.43,1:42:33.33,*ENG,885,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.58,1:42:36.12,*ENG,886,0,0,0,,They didn't die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.03,1:42:43.23,*ENG,887,0,0,0,,But you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.67,1:42:44.82,*ENG,888,0,0,0,,Because you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.78,1:42:47.60,*ENG,889,0,0,0,,Harry's heart did beat for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.81,1:42:49.01,*ENG,890,0,0,0,,For all of us!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.22,1:42:50.56,*ENG,891,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.21,1:42:56.95,*ENG,892,0,0,0,,Confringo
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.22,1:43:13.58,*ENG,893,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.46,1:43:19.23,*ENG,894,0,0,0,,All remain into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.23,1:43:20.66,*ENG,895,0,0,0,,We have to kill the snake.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.66,1:43:21.52,*ENG,896,0,0,0,,Use this!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.53,1:43:22.31,*ENG,897,0,0,0,,Neville!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.48,1:46:19.68,*ENG,898,0,0,0,,Not my daughter, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.47,1:46:53.64,*ENG,899,0,0,0,,Hey, you were right...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.54,1:46:57.76,*ENG,900,0,0,0,,...when you told Professor Snape that wand was failing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.76,1:46:58.79,*ENG,901,0,0,0,,It will always fail...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.03,1:47:02.82,*ENG,902,0,0,0,,I killed Snape!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.82,1:47:04.68,*ENG,903,0,0,0,,But what if the wand never belonged to Snape?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.90,1:47:07.25,*ENG,904,0,0,0,,What if its allegiance is always to someone else?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.07,1:47:09.12,*ENG,905,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Tom...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.37,1:47:11.70,*ENG,906,0,0,0,,Let's finish this the way we started.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.96,1:47:13.38,*ENG,907,0,0,0,,Together! Die!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.00,1:51:00.17,*ENG,908,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.67,1:52:03.79,*ENG,909,0,0,0,,Why didn't it work for him? The Elder Wand?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.46,1:52:07.41,*ENG,910,0,0,0,,It answered to somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.24,1:52:11.19,*ENG,911,0,0,0,,When he killed Snape, he thought the wand would become his.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.19,1:52:12.33,*ENG,912,0,0,0,,But the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.42,1:52:14.89,*ENG,913,0,0,0,,The wand never belonged to Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.76,1:52:19.49,*ENG,914,0,0,0,,It was Draco, who disarmed Dumbledore that night in the Astronomy tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.35,1:52:23.80,*ENG,915,0,0,0,,From that moment on and the wand answered him,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.42,1:52:29.73,*ENG,916,0,0,0,,Until, the other night when I disarmed Draco.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.07,1:52:31.77,*ENG,917,0,0,0,,At Malfoy Manor.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.77,1:52:33.43,*ENG,918,0,0,0,,So, that means...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.57,1:52:36.71,*ENG,919,0,0,0,,It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.39,1:52:42.42,*ENG,920,0,0,0,,- What should we do with it? - We?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.40,1:52:45.04,*ENG,921,0,0,0,,Just saying, that's the Elder Wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.39,1:52:47.54,*ENG,922,0,0,0,,The most powerful wand in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.12,1:52:51.13,*ENG,923,0,0,0,,With that, he'd be invincible.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.54,1:54:24.29,*ENG,924,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.90,1:55:16.08,*ENG,925,0,0,0,,Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.29,1:55:56.79,*ENG,926,0,0,0,,- Bag? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.27,1:55:58.49,*ENG,927,0,0,0,,Jumper?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.40,1:56:02.02,*ENG,928,0,0,0,,I'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.85,1:56:04.33,*ENG,929,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.97,1:56:20.80,*ENG,930,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.49,1:56:23.58,*ENG,931,0,0,0,,What if I am put in Slytherin?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.34,1:56:33.12,*ENG,932,0,0,0,,Albus Severus Potter. You were named after two Headmasters of Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.91,1:56:39.08,*ENG,933,0,0,0,,One of them was a Slytherin. And he was the bravest man I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.08,1:56:44.08,*ENG,934,0,0,0,,- But just say if I am... - Then Slytherin house...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.09,1:56:47.68,*ENG,935,0,0,0,,...will have gained a wonderful young wizard.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.60,1:56:49.89,*ENG,936,0,0,0,,But listen...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.99,1:56:53.68,*ENG,937,0,0,0,,If it really means that much to you, you can choose Gryffindor.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.25,1:56:56.78,*ENG,938,0,0,0,,The Sorting Hat takes your choice into account.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.29,1:56:59.97,*ENG,939,0,0,0,,- Really? - Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.87,1:57:06.00,*ENG,940,0,0,0,,- Ready? - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.98,1:57:26.72,*ENG,941,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:49.00,*CHS,2,0,0,0,,《哈利波特与死亡圣器（下）》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:02:01.32,*CHS,3,0,0,0,,(多比长眠于此  一个自由的精灵)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.12,*CHS,4,0,0,0,,这儿真美
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:40.26,*CHS,5,0,0,0,,是姨妈的房子，小时候我们常来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.36,*CHS,6,0,0,0,,现在是凤凰社的藏身地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:46.98,*CHS,7,0,0,0,,总算还有个住处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.83,*CHS,8,0,0,0,,麻瓜认为风铃能辟邪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.71,*CHS,9,0,0,0,,其实没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:57.55,*CHS,10,0,0,0,,我要跟妖精谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:10.87,*CHS,11,0,0,0,,您怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:14.29,*CHS,12,0,0,0,,还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:20.77,*CHS,13,0,0,0,,您可能已经不记得…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:24.03,*CHS,14,0,0,0,,记得你第一次来古灵阁时，就是我带你去的金库？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:28.08,*CHS,15,0,0,0,,即使在妖精界你也相当有名，哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.46,*CHS,16,0,0,0,,- 你安葬了那只精灵？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.51,*CHS,17,0,0,0,,还救我到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.63,*CHS,18,0,0,0,,你真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.67,*CHS,19,0,0,0,,与众不同啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:54.31,*CHS,20,0,0,0,,你是怎么得到宝剑的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.66,*CHS,21,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:05.74,*CHS,22,0,0,0,,贝拉特里克斯·莱斯特兰奇的金库里有什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.84,*CHS,23,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:16.12,*CHS,24,0,0,0,,宝剑是自己出现的，在我们需要的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.65,*CHS,25,0,0,0,,我们没偷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.25,0:04:24.66,*CHS,26,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人的金库里有把一模一样的宝剑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.92,0:04:26.60,*CHS,27,0,0,0,,但那把是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:28.69,*CHS,28,0,0,0,,夏天时被人调包了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:30.40,*CHS,29,0,0,0,,而她从没怀疑过那是假的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.83,*CHS,30,0,0,0,,因为它仿得十分逼真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:35.28,*CHS,31,0,0,0,,只有妖精才能看出来这把才是真的格兰芬多宝剑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.40,*CHS,32,0,0,0,,是谁调的包？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:39.23,*CHS,33,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨的一位教授
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.30,*CHS,34,0,0,0,,就我所知他现在是校长
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:44.51,*CHS,35,0,0,0,,斯内普
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:47.53,*CHS,36,0,0,0,,如果莱斯特兰奇金库里的是赝品…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.20,*CHS,37,0,0,0,,怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:53.87,*CHS,38,0,0,0,,古灵阁金库里的秘密可不止一两个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.78,*CHS,39,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人的金库里也有秘密么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:02.25,*CHS,40,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:08.45,*CHS,41,0,0,0,,我要进入古灵阁，进一个金库
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.34,*CHS,42,0,0,0,,- 绝无可能 - 我自己确实不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.61,*CHS,43,0,0,0,,但是有你在，就可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:21.88,*CHS,44,0,0,0,,- 我为什么要帮你？ - 我有金币
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.78,*CHS,45,0,0,0,,很多很多金币
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.49,*CHS,46,0,0,0,,我对金币不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:26.77,*CHS,47,0,0,0,,那你要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:33.75,*CHS,48,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:36.15,*CHS,49,0,0,0,,那就是我的开价
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.37,0:05:51.99,*CHS,50,0,0,0,,你觉得贝拉特里克斯的金库里有魂器？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.28,*CHS,51,0,0,0,,她以为我们去过金库，都吓疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:56.42,*CHS,52,0,0,0,,不停问我，还拿了什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:59.82,*CHS,53,0,0,0,,我敢肯定那里有魂器，有他灵魂的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:03.26,*CHS,54,0,0,0,,我们去找，销毁魂器，就离杀死他更近了一步
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:04.38,*CHS,55,0,0,0,,可是如果你把宝剑给了拉环
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:07.44,*CHS,56,0,0,0,,我们找到魂器后要怎么销毁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:10.17,*CHS,57,0,0,0,,这我还没想好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:13.93,*CHS,58,0,0,0,,他很虚弱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.12,*CHS,59,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.64,0:06:28.12,*CHS,60,0,0,0,,奥利凡德先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.12,*CHS,61,0,0,0,,我有些问题需要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:33.16,*CHS,62,0,0,0,,可以，孩子，在所不辞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:39.59,*CHS,63,0,0,0,,能帮我鉴定下这根魔杖吗？ 我想知道用它安不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.98,0:06:47.63,*CHS,64,0,0,0,,嗯…胡桃木
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:51.02,*CHS,65,0,0,0,,龙心弦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:55.01,*CHS,66,0,0,0,,12.75英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.60,*CHS,67,0,0,0,,不易…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.26,*CHS,68,0,0,0,,不易弯曲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:06.52,*CHS,69,0,0,0,,这根魔杖属于贝拉特里克斯·莱斯特兰奇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:09.06,*CHS,70,0,0,0,,小心使用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.13,*CHS,71,0,0,0,,这根呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:16.68,*CHS,72,0,0,0,,山楂木
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:20.34,*CHS,73,0,0,0,,独角兽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.99,*CHS,74,0,0,0,,10英寸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:25.30,*CHS,75,0,0,0,,弹性适中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:33.20,*CHS,76,0,0,0,,这曾是德拉科·马尔福的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:35.66,*CHS,77,0,0,0,,曾是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.28,*CHS,78,0,0,0,,难道现在不是了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.28,0:07:40.67,*CHS,79,0,0,0,,可能不是了，如果被你夺到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:46.68,*CHS,80,0,0,0,,我能感到它已改变了效忠对象
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:56.52,*CHS,81,0,0,0,,您把魔杖说得好像有感情一样…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.67,*CHS,82,0,0,0,,还能思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:07.80,*CHS,83,0,0,0,,魔杖选择巫师，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:13.53,*CHS,84,0,0,0,,这对我们研究魔杖学问的人来说，一直很明确
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:18.24,*CHS,85,0,0,0,,那您知道死亡圣器么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.91,*CHS,86,0,0,0,,传说有三件圣器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:36.15,*CHS,87,0,0,0,,老魔杖、能让你躲避敌人的隐形衣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:41.82,*CHS,88,0,0,0,,还有复活石，能让你爱的人起死回生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:46.88,*CHS,89,0,0,0,,同时拥有三件圣器，你就是死亡的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:53.72,*CHS,90,0,0,0,,但是，没几个人相信这种东西真的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.76,0:08:55.00,*CHS,91,0,0,0,,您呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.97,*CHS,92,0,0,0,,您相信它们存在吗，先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.46,*CHS,93,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:07.78,*CHS,94,0,0,0,,我觉得没必要相信这老掉牙的传说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.87,*CHS,95,0,0,0,,你在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.89,*CHS,96,0,0,0,,你知道有一件存在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.66,0:09:18.27,*CHS,97,0,0,0,,你告诉了他，你告诉了他老魔杖的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.30,0:09:21.10,*CHS,98,0,0,0,,还有去哪儿能找到它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.45,*CHS,99,0,0,0,,他拷问我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:30.93,*CHS,100,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:34.23,*CHS,101,0,0,0,,我只是告诉了他传说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:38.01,*CHS,102,0,0,0,,传说…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:42.62,*CHS,103,0,0,0,,传说并没有讲怎样能找到老魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.64,0:09:47.61,*CHS,104,0,0,0,,他已经找到了，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:55.07,*CHS,105,0,0,0,,您好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.13,*CHS,106,0,0,0,,他在找你，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:03.68,*CHS,107,0,0,0,,如果你说的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.78,*CHS,108,0,0,0,,他找到了老魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.55,0:10:10.23,*CHS,109,0,0,0,,恐怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.93,*CHS,110,0,0,0,,你就真的没希望赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:17.54,*CHS,111,0,0,0,,那我就在他找到我之前杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:25.42,*CHS,112,0,0,0,,你肯定这是她的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:28.94,*CHS,113,0,0,0,,肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.37,*CHS,114,0,0,0,,怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.23,*CHS,115,0,0,0,,看起来如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:41.02,*CHS,116,0,0,0,,好吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:45.07,*CHS,117,0,0,0,,可以让赫敏拿着剑吗，拉环？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.85,*CHS,118,0,0,0,,我们就靠你了，拉环
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:08.95,*CHS,119,0,0,0,,如果你能带我们穿过金库的守卫…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:10.15,*CHS,120,0,0,0,,宝剑就归你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.93,*CHS,121,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:26.12,*CHS,122,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.77,0:11:31.73,*CHS,123,0,0,0,,早上好？早上好？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.77,0:11:34.93,*CHS,124,0,0,0,,你是贝拉特里克斯·莱斯特兰奇，不是小学生！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.47,*CHS,125,0,0,0,,嘿！冷静点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:41.56,*CHS,126,0,0,0,,要是她漏了马脚，我们就只能用宝剑来自刎了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.92,*CHS,127,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.12,*CHS,128,0,0,0,,他说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:46.58,*CHS,129,0,0,0,,我刚才傻死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.53,0:11:50.29,*CHS,130,0,0,0,,好了，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.27,0:12:58.34,*CHS,131,0,0,0,,我要去我的金库
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:03.81,*CHS,132,0,0,0,,有身份证明么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:09.39,*CHS,133,0,0,0,,我看没那个必要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:13.87,*CHS,134,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:21.33,*CHS,135,0,0,0,,我可不想等太久
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.86,0:13:23.21,*CHS,136,0,0,0,,他们知道了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.77,*CHS,137,0,0,0,,他们知道她是冒充的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.62,*CHS,138,0,0,0,,他们一定得到了警告
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.34,0:13:39.58,*CHS,139,0,0,0,,哈利…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.04,*CHS,140,0,0,0,,怎么办啊，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:51.81,*CHS,141,0,0,0,,莱斯特兰奇夫人，可否请您出示下您的魔杖？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.64,*CHS,142,0,0,0,,干嘛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:59.51,*CHS,143,0,0,0,,这是银行规定，请您务必谅解 现在形势特殊嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:03.46,*CHS,144,0,0,0,,不，我一点都不理解！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:07.06,*CHS,145,0,0,0,,抱歉，我必须要看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.84,0:14:14.24,*CHS,146,0,0,0,,魂魄出窍！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.04,0:14:22.12,*CHS,147,0,0,0,,好吧，莱斯特兰奇夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.26,*CHS,148,0,0,0,,请跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.21,*CHS,149,0,0,0,,那是什么，拉环？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.88,*CHS,150,0,0,0,,拉环？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:29.37,*CHS,151,0,0,0,,减震咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:34.87,*CHS,152,0,0,0,,干得好，赫敏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.06,0:15:44.99,*CHS,153,0,0,0,,遭了！你们俩又变回原样了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.67,0:15:49.53,*CHS,154,0,0,0,,防贼瀑布会冲掉所有魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.85,*CHS,155,0,0,0,,会很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:52.42,*CHS,156,0,0,0,,我们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.79,0:15:55.30,*CHS,157,0,0,0,,顺便问下，这还有别的出路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.86,0:15:56.36,*CHS,158,0,0,0,,没了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:02.02,*CHS,159,0,0,0,,你们有何企图，为什么来这？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.43,0:16:03.69,*CHS,160,0,0,0,,小偷！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:04.72,*CHS,161,0,0,0,,你不想再…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:06.68,*CHS,162,0,0,0,,- 魂魄出窍！- 你!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.37,*CHS,163,0,0,0,,听上去不妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.97,*CHS,164,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.13,0:16:32.61,*CHS,165,0,0,0,,这家伙怎么病怏怏的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:33.49,*CHS,166,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:48.16,*CHS,167,0,0,0,,它受过训练，听到这个声音就会想到疼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:49.82,*CHS,168,0,0,0,,真残忍！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.16,*CHS,169,0,0,0,,荧光闪烁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:26.62,*CHS,170,0,0,0,,这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:36.30,*CHS,171,0,0,0,,魂器飞来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.49,*CHS,172,0,0,0,,你想在这试飞来咒啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.42,*CHS,173,0,0,0,,那种魔法在古灵阁里没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.79,*CHS,174,0,0,0,,在这儿吗，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.57,*CHS,175,0,0,0,,你能感觉到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:15.93,*CHS,176,0,0,0,,找到了！在那上边！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:22.85,*CHS,177,0,0,0,,他们在这施了复制咒，被碰到的东西都会自我复制
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.33,*CHS,178,0,0,0,,把剑给我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:43.56,*CHS,179,0,0,0,,别动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:08.15,*CHS,180,0,0,0,,抓住它！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.53,0:19:13.57,*CHS,181,0,0,0,,- 我们说好的，拉环！ - 拿剑来换金杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:23.87,*CHS,182,0,0,0,,我答应带你进来，可我没答应过带你出去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:48.60,*CHS,183,0,0,0,,拉环！求你别走！拉环！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:50.30,*CHS,184,0,0,0,,嘿，怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:55.16,*CHS,185,0,0,0,,要是没有丁当片…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.22,*CHS,186,0,0,0,,那是鲍格罗德
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.35,*CHS,187,0,0,0,,真是不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:11.97,*CHS,188,0,0,0,,我们不能傻站在这，快想办法！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:13.63,*CHS,189,0,0,0,,你不是最聪明的么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:16.13,*CHS,190,0,0,0,,我有个主意，但是很疯狂！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:17.19,*CHS,191,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:32.05,*CHS,192,0,0,0,,快上来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:35.32,*CHS,193,0,0,0,,力松劲泄！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.91,0:21:23.88,*CHS,194,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:52.39,*CHS,195,0,0,0,,接下来呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.85,*CHS,196,0,0,0,,粉身碎骨！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:56.00,*CHS,197,0,0,0,,抓紧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:09.51,*CHS,198,0,0,0,,太厉害了！有才！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.39,0:22:38.76,*CHS,199,0,0,0,,下降了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:44.31,*CHS,200,0,0,0,,- 我们跳吧！ - 什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:45.27,*CHS,201,0,0,0,,现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.40,0:23:41.03,*CHS,202,0,0,0,,他知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.74,0:23:42.44,*CHS,203,0,0,0,,“神秘人”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:44.91,*CHS,204,0,0,0,,他知道我们闯进了古灵阁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.16,0:23:47.76,*CHS,205,0,0,0,,他知道我们拿了什么，他也知道我们在找魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:49.96,*CHS,206,0,0,0,,- 他怎么知道的？ - 我让他知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:53.22,*CHS,207,0,0,0,,你让他进入了你的思想？ 哈利，你不能这么做！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:54.85,*CHS,208,0,0,0,,赫敏，我有时控制不住！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:56.85,*CHS,209,0,0,0,,也许能吧，我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:58.38,*CHS,210,0,0,0,,别争这个了，你看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:24:00.58,*CHS,211,0,0,0,,他很愤怒…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.61,0:24:02.10,*CHS,212,0,0,0,,也很惊恐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:05.59,*CHS,213,0,0,0,,他明白，如果我们毁了所有的魂器，就能杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.96,0:24:08.88,*CHS,214,0,0,0,,他会不惜一切代价阻止我们找到其他魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.04,0:24:11.88,*CHS,215,0,0,0,,还有一个魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:13.23,*CHS,216,0,0,0,,就在霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:14.36,*CHS,217,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:16.07,*CHS,218,0,0,0,,你看见了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.14,*CHS,219,0,0,0,,我看到了霍格沃茨城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:18.30,*CHS,220,0,0,0,,还有罗伊纳·拉文克劳
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.33,0:24:19.61,*CHS,221,0,0,0,,一定是跟她有关
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.65,0:24:20.75,*CHS,222,0,0,0,,我们必须去学校，现在就去！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:21.97,*CHS,223,0,0,0,,我们不能现在动身！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:24.63,*CHS,224,0,0,0,,我们得制定计划，得好好想清楚！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:27.32,*CHS,225,0,0,0,,赫敏，我们哪次计划顺利进行过？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.36,0:24:29.67,*CHS,226,0,0,0,,等我们计划好了再去，就太迟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.07,0:24:33.51,*CHS,227,0,0,0,,他说得对！但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:36.76,*CHS,228,0,0,0,,斯内普现在是校长，我们不能走正门啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.51,0:24:40.63,*CHS,229,0,0,0,,那…我们去霍格莫德
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:42.04,*CHS,230,0,0,0,,去蜂蜜公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.07,0:24:43.57,*CHS,231,0,0,0,,走地窖里的密道
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.82,0:24:44.91,*CHS,232,0,0,0,,他…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:46.94,*CHS,233,0,0,0,,他有些不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:49.74,*CHS,234,0,0,0,,就好像，以前…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.67,0:24:52.33,*CHS,235,0,0,0,,我总能看到他的思想
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.36,0:24:54.51,*CHS,236,0,0,0,,但现在都是杂乱无章的片段
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.84,0:24:58.03,*CHS,237,0,0,0,,也许是因为魂器被毁，也许他正渐渐虚弱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.07,0:24:59.10,*CHS,238,0,0,0,,也许他快死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.14,0:24:59.97,*CHS,239,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.01,0:25:01.64,*CHS,240,0,0,0,,更像是受了伤
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.79,0:25:04.05,*CHS,241,0,0,0,,可以肯定一点，他比以往更危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.50,0:25:56.77,*CHS,242,0,0,0,,- 在这儿，快点！ - 仔细搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.77,0:25:57.21,*CHS,243,0,0,0,,快去!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.00,0:26:18.10,*CHS,244,0,0,0,,快!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:33.00,*CHS,245,0,0,0,,到这来，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:47.40,*CHS,246,0,0,0,,你看见他了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.90,0:26:50.86,*CHS,247,0,0,0,,- 我差点以为是… - 我懂，像邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.44,0:27:08.59,*CHS,248,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.05,0:27:12.50,*CHS,249,0,0,0,,我能从这里看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.93,0:27:28.77,*CHS,250,0,0,0,,你们几个笨蛋，来这干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:31.75,*CHS,251,0,0,0,,知道这有多危险吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.78,0:27:34.71,*CHS,252,0,0,0,,你是阿不福思，邓布利多的弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.03,0:27:37.85,*CHS,253,0,0,0,,我在镜子里看到的就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.64,0:27:40.02,*CHS,254,0,0,0,,是你派多比救我的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.38,0:27:42.64,*CHS,255,0,0,0,,- 他怎么没跟你们一起？ - 他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:46.02,*CHS,256,0,0,0,,真是可惜，我喜欢那只小精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.13,0:27:47.46,*CHS,257,0,0,0,,谁给你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.49,0:27:48.10,*CHS,258,0,0,0,,那面镜子？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:52.17,*CHS,259,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯·弗莱奇，约一年前
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.20,0:27:53.61,*CHS,260,0,0,0,,蒙顿格斯没权给你，它属于…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:54.53,*CHS,261,0,0,0,,小天狼星…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.85,0:27:57.28,*CHS,262,0,0,0,,阿不思告诉我了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.32,0:28:00.97,*CHS,263,0,0,0,,他还说要是你发现了镜子在我这
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.00,0:28:04.08,*CHS,264,0,0,0,,肯定会生气的，不过你扪心自问
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.12,0:28:06.51,*CHS,265,0,0,0,,要是不在我这你会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.80,0:28:13.08,*CHS,266,0,0,0,,有其他凤凰社成员的消息么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.30,0:28:14.94,*CHS,267,0,0,0,,凤凰社完了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.75,0:28:16.88,*CHS,268,0,0,0,,“神秘人”已经赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.22,0:28:20.21,*CHS,269,0,0,0,,谁敢不这么说就是自寻死路
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.93,0:28:22.85,*CHS,270,0,0,0,,我们要进入霍格沃茨，就今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.86,0:28:25.12,*CHS,271,0,0,0,,邓布利多给了我们一项任务
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:26.79,*CHS,272,0,0,0,,是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.64,0:28:29.59,*CHS,273,0,0,0,,轻松愉快的好任务么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.25,*CHS,274,0,0,0,,我们在找魂器
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:35.35,*CHS,275,0,0,0,,我们认为最后一件就在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.39,0:28:36.49,*CHS,276,0,0,0,,但需要你的帮助才能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:40.35,*CHS,277,0,0,0,,我哥给的这哪是什么任务啊，简直是自杀行动
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.68,0:28:42.62,*CHS,278,0,0,0,,拜托，孩子，回家去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.27,0:28:44.16,*CHS,279,0,0,0,,还能多活几天
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:45.79,*CHS,280,0,0,0,,邓布利多相信我能完成任务
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.79,0:28:47.93,*CHS,281,0,0,0,,你怎么知道你能相信他？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.32,0:28:51.84,*CHS,282,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我哥跟你说的话都可信？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.29,*CHS,283,0,0,0,,你认识他这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.54,0:28:55.38,*CHS,284,0,0,0,,他可曾提起过我？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.95,0:28:58.27,*CHS,285,0,0,0,,可曾提起过她？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:02.19,*CHS,286,0,0,0,,- 他干嘛要… - 要保密？你说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.63,0:29:06.10,*CHS,287,0,0,0,,- 我信任他 - 这答案太幼稚了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:12.33,*CHS,288,0,0,0,,邓布利多连从何找起都没告诉你 你就为他的片面之词搜集魂器？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:13.57,*CHS,289,0,0,0,,你骗人！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.02,0:29:17.61,*CHS,290,0,0,0,,你骗我不要紧，但你在骗你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.06,0:29:19.65,*CHS,291,0,0,0,,这是愚蠢之举
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.34,0:29:23.79,*CHS,292,0,0,0,,我看你不像是蠢人啊，哈利·波特！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:27.60,*CHS,293,0,0,0,,我再问一遍，是什么原因
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.79,0:29:33.55,*CHS,294,0,0,0,,我对你们兄弟间的恩怨不感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.99,0:29:37.11,*CHS,295,0,0,0,,我不在乎你已经放弃战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.61,0:29:41.16,*CHS,296,0,0,0,,我信任邓布利多
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:47.75,*CHS,297,0,0,0,,我们今晚要进入霍格沃茨
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.92,0:29:55.35,*CHS,298,0,0,0,,你知道该做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:04.09,*CHS,299,0,0,0,,你让她去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.75,0:30:05.95,*CHS,300,0,0,0,,你会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.45,0:30:08.14,*CHS,301,0,0,0,,很快
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:16.76,*CHS,302,0,0,0,,那是你妹妹，阿利安娜，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.50,0:30:20.32,*CHS,303,0,0,0,,她很年轻就过世了，是么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.33,0:30:27.72,*CHS,304,0,0,0,,我哥为了追求力量牺牲了许多东西，波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:29.81,*CHS,305,0,0,0,,包括阿利安娜
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:33.03,*CHS,306,0,0,0,,她很崇拜他
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:36.35,*CHS,307,0,0,0,,他给了她一切
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.50,*CHS,308,0,0,0,,却没给她时间
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.49,0:30:42.68,*CHS,309,0,0,0,,谢谢您，邓布利多先生
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.83,0:30:52.29,*CHS,310,0,0,0,,他救了我们两次
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.88,0:30:55.30,*CHS,311,0,0,0,,还通过镜子关注我们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:30:59.52,*CHS,312,0,0,0,,这不像是要放弃战斗的人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.12,0:31:07.03,*CHS,313,0,0,0,,她回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:09.68,*CHS,314,0,0,0,,她后边是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:19.50,*CHS,315,0,0,0,,纳威！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.53,0:31:20.86,*CHS,316,0,0,0,,- 你怎么这么… - 狼狈，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.65,0:31:22.62,*CHS,317,0,0,0,,这没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.98,0:31:24.22,*CHS,318,0,0,0,,西莫比我还惨
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.02,0:31:26.10,*CHS,319,0,0,0,,嘿，阿不！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.14,0:31:27.88,*CHS,320,0,0,0,,我们还有几个人要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.42,0:31:31.39,*CHS,321,0,0,0,,不记得地图上有这条道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:33.21,*CHS,322,0,0,0,,因为是新开通的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.25,0:31:36.48,*CHS,323,0,0,0,,原来7条密道开学前就被封了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.40,*CHS,324,0,0,0,,现在只有这一条路可以进出
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:41.65,*CHS,325,0,0,0,,到处都是食死徒和摄魂怪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.75,*CHS,326,0,0,0,,斯内普校长当得怎么样啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.78,0:31:44.84,*CHS,327,0,0,0,,我都没见过他
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.87,0:31:46.60,*CHS,328,0,0,0,,一直是卡罗兄妹在监视学生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.04,0:31:47.95,*CHS,329,0,0,0,,卡罗兄妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.99,0:31:50.55,*CHS,330,0,0,0,,是啊，管纪律的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.59,0:31:52.21,*CHS,331,0,0,0,,他们喜欢体罚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:53.69,*CHS,332,0,0,0,,他们把你弄这样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.98,0:31:54.80,*CHS,333,0,0,0,,为什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.84,0:31:58.00,*CHS,334,0,0,0,,今天黑魔法防御术课要练钻心咒
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.03,0:31:59.72,*CHS,335,0,0,0,,对一年级新生用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.64,0:32:02.55,*CHS,336,0,0,0,,我不愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.52,0:32:04.99,*CHS,337,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨已经变了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.24,0:32:20.18,*CHS,338,0,0,0,,来开心一下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:27.81,*CHS,339,0,0,0,,嘿，看我带什么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.84,0:32:29.06,*CHS,340,0,0,0,,有惊喜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.34,0:32:30.98,*CHS,341,0,0,0,,但愿不是阿不福思做的饭
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.66,0:32:33.11,*CHS,342,0,0,0,,我还能消化它就已经是惊喜了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:38.17,*CHS,343,0,0,0,,- 噢，天呐！ - 哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.25,0:32:54.77,*CHS,344,0,0,0,,去告诉卢平他们，哈利回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.42,0:32:56.55,*CHS,345,0,0,0,,好啦，好啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.65,0:32:59.09,*CHS,346,0,0,0,,不用等“神秘人”，他就先被我们抱死了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.09,0:33:01.21,*CHS,347,0,0,0,,…收到了吗？最新天气预报，闪电已划破长空
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.22,0:33:02.81,*CHS,348,0,0,0,,重复，闪电已划破长空
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:04.71,*CHS,349,0,0,0,,有什么计划，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:10.54,*CHS,350,0,0,0,,好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.34,0:33:13.04,*CHS,351,0,0,0,,我们要找一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.79,0:33:15.54,*CHS,352,0,0,0,,有一样东西就藏在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.12,0:33:17.81,*CHS,353,0,0,0,,可能会有助于我们打败“神秘人”
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.84,0:33:22.07,*CHS,354,0,0,0,,- 好吧，什么东西？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.92,0:33:26.02,*CHS,355,0,0,0,,- 它在哪儿？ - 也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.26,0:33:29.25,*CHS,356,0,0,0,,我们知道的信息不多
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.56,0:33:30.16,*CHS,357,0,0,0,,根本就没有信息
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.48,0:33:33.49,*CHS,358,0,0,0,,我觉得它跟拉文克劳有关
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.16,0:33:38.63,*CHS,359,0,0,0,,应该很小巧，易于藏匿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.74,0:33:41.01,*CHS,360,0,0,0,,有人想到什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.43,0:33:45.66,*CHS,361,0,0,0,,是罗伊纳·拉文克劳的丢失的冠冕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.70,0:33:46.90,*CHS,362,0,0,0,,天啊，又开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.61,0:33:50.14,*CHS,363,0,0,0,,拉文克劳丢失的冠冕？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.28,0:33:52.43,*CHS,364,0,0,0,,有人听说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.33,0:33:54.80,*CHS,365,0,0,0,,很有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.84,0:33:56.79,*CHS,366,0,0,0,,听说过，但是卢娜，冠冕已经丢了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.83,0:34:00.59,*CHS,367,0,0,0,,丢了几百年了，没有活人见过它
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.42,0:34:03.83,*CHS,368,0,0,0,,不好意思，谁能告诉我冠冕是什么鬼东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:05.00,*CHS,369,0,0,0,,是一个皇冠
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:06.48,*CHS,370,0,0,0,,像头饰那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:11.23,*CHS,371,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.22,0:34:13.65,*CHS,372,0,0,0,,嗨，你好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.06,0:34:19.88,*CHS,373,0,0,0,,6个月没见她就像不认识我似的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:20.87,*CHS,374,0,0,0,,我可是她哥啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.19,0:34:23.81,*CHS,375,0,0,0,,- 哥哥有很多，可哈利只有一个 - 闭嘴，西莫！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:25.50,*CHS,376,0,0,0,,怎么了，金妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.19,0:34:29.57,*CHS,377,0,0,0,,斯内普发现了…他发现哈利去霍格莫德了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:14.16,*CHS,378,0,0,0,,你们一定很纳闷，我为什么大半夜叫你们集合
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.54,0:35:20.05,*CHS,379,0,0,0,,今晚早些时候，我发现…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.68,0:35:24.84,*CHS,380,0,0,0,,哈利·波特出现在霍格莫德
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.42,0:35:28.43,*CHS,381,0,0,0,,现在…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.18,0:35:30.56,*CHS,382,0,0,0,,要是有人…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:37.91,*CHS,383,0,0,0,,不论是学生还是教员，胆敢协助波特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.97,0:35:47.61,*CHS,384,0,0,0,,都将受到与其行为同等严重的惩罚，不仅如此
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.36,0:35:52.03,*CHS,385,0,0,0,,要是有人知道什么情况…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:57.72,*CHS,386,0,0,0,,却隐瞒不报…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.32,0:36:06.73,*CHS,387,0,0,0,,也将受到严惩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.04,0:36:11.20,*CHS,388,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.35,0:36:23.31,*CHS,389,0,0,0,,要是有人知道波特先生今晚的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:29.13,*CHS,390,0,0,0,,我建议你最好站出来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.58,0:36:35.11,*CHS,391,0,0,0,,就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:53.92,*CHS,392,0,0,0,,看来您貌似滴水不漏的防御措施…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.96,0:36:56.62,*CHS,393,0,0,0,,还是有安全隐患啊，校长…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.43,0:37:02.16,*CHS,394,0,0,0,,隐患还不小呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.96,0:37:05.80,*CHS,395,0,0,0,,你怎么还有脸站在他的位置上？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.64,0:37:11.70,*CHS,396,0,0,0,,告诉大家那晚发生了什么！告诉大家你是怎样看着他的眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.73,0:37:14.23,*CHS,397,0,0,0,,他那么信任你，你却杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.34,0:37:15.56,*CHS,398,0,0,0,,说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.46,0:37:54.49,*CHS,399,0,0,0,,哈利
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:56.25,*CHS,400,0,0,0,,波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:35.58,*CHS,401,0,0,0,,我知道你们很多人都想反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.17,0:38:41.68,*CHS,402,0,0,0,,甚至有人还以为反抗是明智的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.72,0:38:44.21,*CHS,403,0,0,0,,真是愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.52,0:38:48.62,*CHS,404,0,0,0,,交出哈利·波特
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.48,0:38:52.91,*CHS,405,0,0,0,,交出他，大家就相安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.67,0:38:59.50,*CHS,406,0,0,0,,交出哈利·波特，我保证霍格沃茨不受损害
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.16,0:39:07.00,*CHS,407,0,0,0,,交出哈利·波特，我会给你们奖赏
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.03,0:39:09.63,*CHS,408,0,0,0,,你们有1小时时间
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.38,0:39:24.04,*CHS,409,0,0,0,,还等什么？快抓住他！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.39,0:39:37.62,*CHS,410,0,0,0,,学生下床了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:41.12,*CHS,411,0,0,0,,- 学生都跑到走廊里了！ - 他们应该下床
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.15,0:39:42.72,*CHS,412,0,0,0,,你这啰嗦的白痴！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.18,0:39:47.76,*CHS,413,0,0,0,,抱歉，夫人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.80,0:39:49.23,*CHS,414,0,0,0,,既然你来了，费尔奇先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.27,0:39:50.93,*CHS,415,0,0,0,,来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.81,0:39:55.48,*CHS,416,0,0,0,,如果可以的话，我想请你把帕金森小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:58.48,*CHS,417,0,0,0,,和斯莱特林学院的其他同学，都带走
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.51,0:40:01.36,*CHS,418,0,0,0,,带他们去哪儿啊，夫人？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.40,0:40:03.01,*CHS,419,0,0,0,,地牢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.78,0:40:11.22,*CHS,420,0,0,0,,你一定是有事才回来的，波特
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:12.38,*CHS,421,0,0,0,,你需要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.41,0:40:15.21,*CHS,422,0,0,0,,时间，教授，越多越好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.50,0:40:17.05,*CHS,423,0,0,0,,做你应做的事去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:18.60,*CHS,424,0,0,0,,我来守护城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:21.54,*CHS,425,0,0,0,,波特…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.99,0:40:25.12,*CHS,426,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:28.45,*CHS,427,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.04,0:40:31.11,*CHS,428,0,0,0,,守住城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.87,0:40:44.24,*CHS,429,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.71,0:40:47.78,*CHS,430,0,0,0,,我跟赫敏刚才在想，就算我们找到了所有魂器也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.81,0:40:48.74,*CHS,431,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.77,0:40:50.17,*CHS,432,0,0,0,,除非你能毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.21,0:40:51.66,*CHS,433,0,0,0,,所以我们就想到…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.66,0:40:53.04,*CHS,434,0,0,0,,是罗恩想到的，是罗恩的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.04,0:40:53.90,*CHS,435,0,0,0,,他真是太聪明了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.34,0:40:56.94,*CHS,436,0,0,0,,你不是用蛇怪的牙毁了汤姆·里德尔的日记吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.04,0:41:00.25,*CHS,437,0,0,0,,我和赫敏可以去找毒牙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.25,*CHS,438,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.87,0:41:03.14,*CHS,439,0,0,0,,去吧，带着这个
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.17,0:41:05.21,*CHS,440,0,0,0,,这样你们回来时就能找到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.00,0:41:06.53,*CHS,441,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.53,0:41:09.34,*CHS,442,0,0,0,,拉文克劳的公共休息室，先找找看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.83,0:41:18.72,*CHS,443,0,0,0,,哈利！哈利！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.36,0:41:20.86,*CHS,444,0,0,0,,我得问清楚了，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.90,0:41:22.71,*CHS,445,0,0,0,,您真允许我们这么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.74,0:41:25.06,*CHS,446,0,0,0,,没错，隆巴顿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.10,0:41:26.81,*CHS,447,0,0,0,,那可是爆炸啊！爆炸！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.84,0:41:27.53,*CHS,448,0,0,0,,快去！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.14,0:41:29.72,*CHS,449,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.75,0:41:31.35,*CHS,450,0,0,0,,我们要怎么炸啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.33,0:41:34.26,*CHS,451,0,0,0,,你可以去请教斐尼甘先生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.30,0:41:38.42,*CHS,452,0,0,0,,我记得他对引爆可是相当有天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.46,0:41:39.24,*CHS,453,0,0,0,,我能炸了它
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.72,0:41:40.86,*CHS,454,0,0,0,,这才像话，快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.04,0:41:46.29,*CHS,455,0,0,0,,你知道的，我们阻挡不了“神秘人”太长时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.33,0:41:48.41,*CHS,456,0,0,0,,我们可以拖住他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.41,0:41:54.48,*CHS,457,0,0,0,,还有，他的名字是伏地魔 菲利乌斯，你也应该这样叫他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.22,0:41:57.31,*CHS,458,0,0,0,,反正他都要来杀你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.32,0:42:03.63,*CHS,459,0,0,0,,石墩出动！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.71,0:42:21.08,*CHS,460,0,0,0,,霍格沃茨危在旦夕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.12,0:42:26.52,*CHS,461,0,0,0,,守卫边界，保护师生，为我学校，尽职尽责！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.24,0:42:33.09,*CHS,462,0,0,0,,我想用这个咒语很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:46.68,*CHS,463,0,0,0,,超强盔甲护身，统统护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.68,0:42:50.50,*CHS,464,0,0,0,,超强盔甲护身，统统护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.38,0:42:57.19,*CHS,465,0,0,0,,超强盔甲护身，统统护卫
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.50,0:43:26.85,*CHS,466,0,0,0,,哈利，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:28.40,*CHS,467,0,0,0,,我有话要说！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.64,0:43:31.02,*CHS,468,0,0,0,,- 我有点忙，卢娜 - 你不知道要去哪儿找
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.02,0:43:32.54,*CHS,469,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.56,0:43:33.51,*CHS,470,0,0,0,,一会儿再说吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.51,0:43:35.60,*CHS,471,0,0,0,,- 哈利？ - 再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.64,0:43:37.80,*CHS,472,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，你现在就给我听着！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.24,0:43:43.17,*CHS,473,0,0,0,,你还记得秋是怎么说拉文克劳冠冕的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.20,0:43:45.36,*CHS,474,0,0,0,,没有活人见过它
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.01,0:43:48.26,*CHS,475,0,0,0,,显然
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.29,0:43:50.30,*CHS,476,0,0,0,,我们得去问死人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.78,0:44:03.31,*CHS,477,0,0,0,,好壮观啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.39,0:44:22.77,*CHS,478,0,0,0,,要找她的话，她就在那里面
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.83,0:44:24.40,*CHS,479,0,0,0,,- 你不一跟我去？ - 不了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:26.62,*CHS,480,0,0,0,,我觉得最好让你俩单独谈
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.64,0:44:28.05,*CHS,481,0,0,0,,她很害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.26,0:44:57.17,*CHS,482,0,0,0,,你是格雷女士
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.22,0:44:59.69,*CHS,483,0,0,0,,拉文克劳塔楼的幽灵
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.72,0:45:01.96,*CHS,484,0,0,0,,我不叫那个名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.00,0:45:03.83,*CHS,485,0,0,0,,对不起，对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.86,0:45:05.14,*CHS,486,0,0,0,,是海莲娜
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.17,0:45:08.30,*CHS,487,0,0,0,,海莲娜·拉文克劳，罗伊纳的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.39,0:45:11.07,*CHS,488,0,0,0,,你是卢娜的朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.11,0:45:12.18,*CHS,489,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:15.09,*CHS,490,0,0,0,,她说你能帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.81,0:45:19.90,*CHS,491,0,0,0,,你要找我母亲的冠冕？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.44,0:45:23.13,*CHS,492,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.84,0:45:25.72,*CHS,493,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.16,0:45:28.80,*CHS,494,0,0,0,,卢娜很善良
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.84,0:45:31.18,*CHS,495,0,0,0,,不像大多数人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.23,0:45:35.57,*CHS,496,0,0,0,,但她错了，我不能帮你！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.00,0:45:42.00,*CHS,497,0,0,0,,求你，别走！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.54,0:45:45.62,*CHS,498,0,0,0,,我要销毁它！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:25.70,*CHS,499,0,0,0,,还是没有长进
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.43,0:46:29.02,*CHS,500,0,0,0,,真遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.81,0:46:32.54,*CHS,501,0,0,0,,主人…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.37,0:46:34.83,*CHS,502,0,0,0,,我们不再等等吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.72,0:46:44.68,*CHS,503,0,0,0,,进攻！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.56,0:47:09.35,*CHS,504,0,0,0,,你也想这样不是吗，海莲娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:13.83,*CHS,505,0,0,0,,你也想毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.25,0:47:16.71,*CHS,506,0,0,0,,许多年前有一个人也承诺会毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.61,0:47:20.07,*CHS,507,0,0,0,,一个奇怪的男孩，名字也很怪
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.11,0:47:21.21,*CHS,508,0,0,0,,汤姆·里德尔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:22.37,*CHS,509,0,0,0,,但他骗了我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.49,0:47:24.39,*CHS,510,0,0,0,,他骗过许多人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.65,0:47:27.92,*CHS,511,0,0,0,,我知道他干了什么！我知道他是谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:31.21,*CHS,512,0,0,0,,他用黑魔法玷污了冠冕！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.97,0:47:47.30,*CHS,513,0,0,0,,我能毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.34,0:47:49.37,*CHS,514,0,0,0,,彻底销毁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.76,0:47:54.21,*CHS,515,0,0,0,,但你得先告诉我他把冠冕藏哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.74,0:47:59.93,*CHS,516,0,0,0,,你肯定知道他藏哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.63,0:48:01.97,*CHS,517,0,0,0,,不是吗，海莲娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.07,0:48:05.45,*CHS,518,0,0,0,,告诉我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.85,0:48:09.32,*CHS,519,0,0,0,,求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.21,0:48:23.20,*CHS,520,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.43,0:48:28.66,*CHS,521,0,0,0,,我觉得你有点像他
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.93,0:48:34.24,*CHS,522,0,0,0,,冠冕就在城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.15,0:48:36.72,*CHS,523,0,0,0,,在一个能藏下所有东西的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.29,0:48:40.54,*CHS,524,0,0,0,,如果你还要问…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.57,0:48:42.17,*CHS,525,0,0,0,,你永远也不会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.06,0:48:45.43,*CHS,526,0,0,0,,如果你知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.46,0:48:46.67,*CHS,527,0,0,0,,你只需开口问
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.98,0:48:50.49,*CHS,528,0,0,0,,谢谢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.62,0:49:06.77,*CHS,529,0,0,0,,告诉麦格教授，我和莱姆斯负责城堡这边
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.63,0:49:10.13,*CHS,530,0,0,0,,是，先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.05,0:49:16.95,*CHS,531,0,0,0,,埃迪，还是告诉麦格教授
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.05,0:49:19.95,*CHS,532,0,0,0,,这边再需要几个帮手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.07,0:49:25.04,*CHS,533,0,0,0,,决定成败的是人信念的强弱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.07,0:49:26.83,*CHS,534,0,0,0,,而不是帮手的多少
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.74,0:49:29.18,*CHS,535,0,0,0,,谁说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.93,0:49:30.99,*CHS,536,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.90,0:49:37.47,*CHS,537,0,0,0,,你还好吗，弗雷德？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:39.36,*CHS,538,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.42,0:49:42.46,*CHS,539,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.13,0:50:01.81,*CHS,540,0,0,0,,哈利做梦时说的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.85,0:50:03.05,*CHS,541,0,0,0,,你不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.84,0:50:06.25,*CHS,542,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.09,0:50:57.50,*CHS,543,0,0,0,,来呀！就凭你们？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.33,0:51:19.04,*CHS,544,0,0,0,,你来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.04,0:51:20.72,*CHS,545,0,0,0,,- 我不行 - 你行！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.21,0:54:21.26,*CHS,546,0,0,0,,纳威！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.21,0:54:39.75,*CHS,547,0,0,0,,一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.95,0:55:27.79,*CHS,548,0,0,0,,快进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.85,0:55:56.98,*CHS,549,0,0,0,,金妮！纳威！你们还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.98,0:55:58.20,*CHS,550,0,0,0,,再好不过了！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.20,0:55:59.86,*CHS,551,0,0,0,,我觉得自己战火熊熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.21,0:56:01.50,*CHS,552,0,0,0,,卢娜在上边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:02.31,*CHS,553,0,0,0,,卢娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:04.81,*CHS,554,0,0,0,,我喜欢她！我现在就得告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:07.97,*CHS,555,0,0,0,,不然天亮前我们可能都没命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.58,0:56:12.61,*CHS,556,0,0,0,,我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.71,0:56:43.41,*CHS,557,0,0,0,,该死！这可怎么找他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.45,0:56:45.21,*CHS,558,0,0,0,,他在这儿！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.21,0:56:46.87,*CHS,559,0,0,0,,- 他刚刚… - 厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.21,0:56:48.14,*CHS,560,0,0,0,,他刚刚消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.71,0:56:50.04,*CHS,561,0,0,0,,我敢肯定我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.54,0:56:55.29,*CHS,562,0,0,0,,他可能去了有求必应屋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.51,0:56:56.98,*CHS,563,0,0,0,,地图上无法显示有求必应屋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.98,0:56:58.37,*CHS,564,0,0,0,,你去年说的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.55,0:57:01.00,*CHS,565,0,0,0,,没错，是我说的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.81,0:57:02.61,*CHS,566,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.26,0:57:05.44,*CHS,567,0,0,0,,有才
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.37,0:57:12.90,*CHS,568,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.16,0:59:06.23,*CHS,569,0,0,0,,很好…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.63,0:59:08.91,*CHS,570,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么，波特？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.35,0:59:11.52,*CHS,571,0,0,0,,我正想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.83,0:59:14.05,*CHS,572,0,0,0,,你拿了我的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.92,0:59:17.05,*CHS,573,0,0,0,,我要夺回来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.08,0:59:18.57,*CHS,574,0,0,0,,现在这根怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.57,0:59:19.74,*CHS,575,0,0,0,,我母亲的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.02,0:59:21.20,*CHS,576,0,0,0,,很强，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.11,0:59:23.02,*CHS,577,0,0,0,,这不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.21,0:59:26.88,*CHS,578,0,0,0,,用着不顺手
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.43,0:59:29.40,*CHS,579,0,0,0,,明白我意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.04,0:59:31.42,*CHS,580,0,0,0,,你为什么没告诉她？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.86,0:59:35.01,*CHS,581,0,0,0,,告诉贝拉特里克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.48,0:59:39.77,*CHS,582,0,0,0,,你明知那就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.74,0:59:42.55,*CHS,583,0,0,0,,却什么都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.05,0:59:43.94,*CHS,584,0,0,0,,动手吧，德拉科！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.73,0:59:45.94,*CHS,585,0,0,0,,别傻站着了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.52,0:59:47.21,*CHS,586,0,0,0,,动手！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.87,0:59:49.76,*CHS,587,0,0,0,,别动！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.30,0:59:52.29,*CHS,588,0,0,0,,除你武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.86,0:59:54.23,*CHS,589,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.23,0:59:55.13,*CHS,590,0,0,0,,昏昏倒地！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.67,1:00:01.89,*CHS,591,0,0,0,,敢动我女朋友，你们死定了！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.09,1:00:25.18,*CHS,592,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.83,1:00:42.23,*CHS,593,0,0,0,,快跑！他们把这鬼地方给点了！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.81,1:01:51.64,*CHS,594,0,0,0,,快！这边！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.37,1:02:00.99,*CHS,595,0,0,0,,不能丢下他们！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.81,1:02:02.81,*CHS,596,0,0,0,,他开玩笑呢吧？！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:15.26,*CHS,597,0,0,0,,要是我们被他们拖死了我就杀了你！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.32,1:02:38.54,*CHS,598,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.18,1:03:27.31,*CHS,599,0,0,0,,主人？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.81,1:03:29.54,*CHS,600,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.78,1:03:40.92,*CHS,601,0,0,0,,过来，纳吉尼，我得保证你的安全
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.03,1:03:54.32,*CHS,602,0,0,0,,是那条蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.26,1:03:56.35,*CHS,603,0,0,0,,最后一件
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.67,1:03:58.38,*CHS,604,0,0,0,,它是最后一件魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.03,1:04:06.60,*CHS,605,0,0,0,,进入他的思想，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.01,1:04:11.18,*CHS,606,0,0,0,,看看他在哪儿，找到他就能找到蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.22,1:04:13.25,*CHS,607,0,0,0,,我们就毁掉所有魂器了！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.19,1:04:42.60,*CHS,608,0,0,0,,主人…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.73,1:04:46.39,*CHS,609,0,0,0,,也许…呃…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.97,1:04:51.49,*CHS,610,0,0,0,,我还是建议停止大范围进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.79,1:04:56.09,*CHS,611,0,0,0,,您亲自去找那个男孩儿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.09,1:04:58.84,*CHS,612,0,0,0,,我不需要找他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.88,1:05:03.75,*CHS,613,0,0,0,,不出今晚，他自会找上门！ 听懂了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.35,1:05:06.54,*CHS,614,0,0,0,,看着我！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.87,1:05:10.89,*CHS,615,0,0,0,,你怎么还有脸说？卢修斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.92,1:05:12.96,*CHS,616,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.74,1:05:17.53,*CHS,617,0,0,0,,去找西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.98,1:05:20.14,*CHS,618,0,0,0,,带他来见我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.39,1:05:30.49,*CHS,619,0,0,0,,我知道他在哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.51,1:05:42.00,*CHS,620,0,0,0,,快上！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.82,1:06:31.38,*CHS,621,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.14,1:07:21.19,*CHS,622,0,0,0,,仅这几个小时，您就用这根魔杖施展了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.26,1:07:23.34,*CHS,623,0,0,0,,高超的魔法，主人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.23,1:07:24.81,*CHS,624,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.76,1:07:33.14,*CHS,625,0,0,0,,不对！高超的是我，而魔杖一直在反抗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.17,1:07:39.17,*CHS,626,0,0,0,,没有魔杖比这根更强 奥利凡德也是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.21,1:07:45.25,*CHS,627,0,0,0,,今晚，等找到了那个男孩儿 魔杖不会让您失望的，我敢保证…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.38,1:07:53.53,*CHS,628,0,0,0,,魔杖听从您，只听从您一人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.30,1:07:55.44,*CHS,629,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.63,1:08:00.60,*CHS,630,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.33,1:08:05.78,*CHS,631,0,0,0,,魔杖真的听从于我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.45,1:08:10.39,*CHS,632,0,0,0,,你是个聪明人，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.74,1:08:12.12,*CHS,633,0,0,0,,你肯定知道…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.84,1:08:19.75,*CHS,634,0,0,0,,- 魔杖到底效忠于谁？ - 效忠您…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.82,1:08:23.17,*CHS,635,0,0,0,,当然是您，主人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.21,1:08:30.72,*CHS,636,0,0,0,,老魔杖没有好好为我效力 因为我不是它真正的主人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.26,1:08:36.77,*CHS,637,0,0,0,,老魔杖属于杀死它前任主人的巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.65,1:08:46.63,*CHS,638,0,0,0,,是你杀了邓布利多，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.12,1:08:52.67,*CHS,639,0,0,0,,只要你活着，老魔杖就不可能真正属于我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.90,1:08:58.47,*CHS,640,0,0,0,,你一直是个忠心耿耿的好仆人，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.09,1:09:03.72,*CHS,641,0,0,0,,但只有我…才能永生
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.15,1:09:09.17,*CHS,642,0,0,0,,主人…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.84,1:09:16.87,*CHS,643,0,0,0,,纳吉尼，杀！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.31,1:10:24.98,*CHS,644,0,0,0,,把这…拿去…求你…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:28.61,*CHS,645,0,0,0,,给我个容器！快点，瓶子之类的！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.41,1:10:49.72,*CHS,646,0,0,0,,放到冥想盆里
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.97,1:10:54.33,*CHS,647,0,0,0,,看着我…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.07,1:11:01.86,*CHS,648,0,0,0,,眼睛跟你妈妈一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.47,1:11:42.51,*CHS,649,0,0,0,,你们的抵抗很英勇，但都是徒劳的…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.91,1:11:55.56,*CHS,650,0,0,0,,我不希望发生这样的事 每一滴巫师的血都是严重的损失
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.56,1:11:58.91,*CHS,651,0,0,0,,因此，我会下令撤军…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.37,1:12:05.44,*CHS,652,0,0,0,,之后，你们可以体面地安置死者
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.97,1:12:12.01,*CHS,653,0,0,0,,哈利·波特，现在我直接对你说
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.66,1:12:20.63,*CHS,654,0,0,0,,今晚，你居然听任朋友为你而死 而不愿亲自来面对我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.03,1:12:27.36,*CHS,655,0,0,0,,真是太可耻了 来禁林找我…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.36,1:12:29.82,*CHS,656,0,0,0,,面对自己的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.93,1:12:36.38,*CHS,657,0,0,0,,如果你不来，我会杀光所有试图窝藏你的人.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.93,1:12:44.38,*CHS,658,0,0,0,,不论男女老幼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.32,1:13:05.75,*CHS,659,0,0,0,,大家都哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.11,1:13:32.50,*CHS,660,0,0,0,,哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.18,1:13:41.12,*CHS,661,0,0,0,,拜托，别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.34,1:13:42.84,*CHS,662,0,0,0,,她去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.83,1:13:46.13,*CHS,663,0,0,0,,是的，她走了…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.55,1:16:00.90,*CHS,664,0,0,0,,怪胎！别跑！我要告诉妈妈！你是怪胎！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.93,1:16:02.83,*CHS,665,0,0,0,,你是怪胎，莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.86,1:16:04.79,*CHS,666,0,0,0,,过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.82,1:16:29.53,*CHS,667,0,0,0,,她嫉妒你，她只是凡人 而你却与众不同
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.86,1:16:31.14,*CHS,668,0,0,0,,别这么说，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.45,1:16:56.54,*CHS,669,0,0,0,,格兰芬多！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.29,1:17:06.60,*CHS,670,0,0,0,,- 你好，我是詹姆 - 你好，我是莉莉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.34,1:17:15.39,*CHS,671,0,0,0,,跟你爹一样，懒惰、傲慢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.46,1:17:17.96,*CHS,672,0,0,0,,不许说我父亲坏话！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.59,1:17:30.41,*CHS,673,0,0,0,,无辜者的鲜血将流淌，主仆将再度联手！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.63,1:17:33.23,*CHS,674,0,0,0,,西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.35,1:17:36.18,*CHS,675,0,0,0,,别杀我！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:38.77,*CHS,676,0,0,0,,预言没说是女人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.57,1:17:42.60,*CHS,677,0,0,0,,说的是一个七月底出生的男孩儿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.98,1:17:44.81,*CHS,678,0,0,0,,是，他认为是莉莉的儿子！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.84,1:17:48.12,*CHS,679,0,0,0,,他要找到他们一家，然后杀光
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.69,1:17:53.29,*CHS,680,0,0,0,,把他们藏起来，都藏起来，我求你了！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.32,1:17:56.70,*CHS,681,0,0,0,,你拿什么跟我交换，西弗勒斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.67,1:18:00.04,*CHS,682,0,0,0,,- 什么都行 - 哈利…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.05,1:18:02.89,*CHS,683,0,0,0,,哈利，我们好爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.93,1:18:07.48,*CHS,684,0,0,0,,非常爱！哈利，妈妈爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.03,1:18:10.50,*CHS,685,0,0,0,,爸爸也爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.36,1:18:13.87,*CHS,686,0,0,0,,哈利要活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.69,1:18:17.93,*CHS,687,0,0,0,,- 要坚强！ - 阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.23,1:18:26.11,*CHS,688,0,0,0,,你说过…你说过的…你会保证她的安全！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.40,1:18:27.79,*CHS,689,0,0,0,,莉莉和詹姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.83,1:18:30.67,*CHS,690,0,0,0,,他们信错了人，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.70,1:18:32.23,*CHS,691,0,0,0,,你不也是么
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.38,1:18:36.46,*CHS,692,0,0,0,,她儿子还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.99,1:18:39.28,*CHS,693,0,0,0,,他不需要保护，黑魔王已经死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.31,1:18:41.11,*CHS,694,0,0,0,,黑魔王还会回来的！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.52,1:18:44.75,*CHS,695,0,0,0,,到时那孩子就会有危险！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.80,1:18:48.27,*CHS,696,0,0,0,,他眼睛和他妈妈一样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.68,1:18:55.26,*CHS,697,0,0,0,,如果你真的爱她…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.49,1:19:02.01,*CHS,698,0,0,0,,不许告诉任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.51,1:19:05.02,*CHS,699,0,0,0,,你是要我永不透露你善良的一面？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.06,1:19:06.26,*CHS,700,0,0,0,,你保证？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.29,1:19:09.26,*CHS,701,0,0,0,,你能每天都冒生命危险保护这孩子吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.26,1:19:13.22,*CHS,702,0,0,0,,他天资平庸，跟他爹一样傲慢无礼
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.26,1:19:15.72,*CHS,703,0,0,0,,有点名气就沾沾自喜
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.72,1:19:17.38,*CHS,704,0,0,0,,不许说我父亲坏话！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.90,1:19:21.85,*CHS,705,0,0,0,,詹姆·波特，懒惰、傲慢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.52,1:19:25.61,*CHS,706,0,0,0,,- 我父亲是个伟大的人！ - 你父亲是个卑鄙小人！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.33,1:19:32.81,*CHS,707,0,0,0,,喝了，它能把魔咒封在手部，但只是暂时的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:36.00,*CHS,708,0,0,0,,- 迟早会扩散 - 我还有多少时间？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.34,1:19:39.78,*CHS,709,0,0,0,,大概一年
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.92,1:19:44.33,*CHS,710,0,0,0,,别走，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.78,1:19:49.54,*CHS,711,0,0,0,,你我都知道伏地魔王已经派马尔福来杀我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.52,1:19:58.01,*CHS,712,0,0,0,,如果他失败了，我想伏地魔定会让你动手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.22,1:20:04.35,*CHS,713,0,0,0,,必须由你杀死我，西弗勒斯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.46,1:20:07.31,*CHS,714,0,0,0,,只有这一个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.52,1:20:12.99,*CHS,715,0,0,0,,只有这样，伏地魔才会完全信任你
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.00,1:20:23.04,*CHS,716,0,0,0,,等时机成熟，你一定要告诉哈利·波特一件事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.55,1:20:30.55,*CHS,717,0,0,0,,但一定要等到伏地魔最虚弱的时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.59,1:20:32.46,*CHS,718,0,0,0,,告诉他什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.40,1:20:38.47,*CHS,719,0,0,0,,伏地魔去戈德里克山谷要杀哈利的那个晚上…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.42,1:20:42.91,*CHS,720,0,0,0,,莉莉·波特用自己的身体挡在他们之间时…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.74,1:20:45.73,*CHS,721,0,0,0,,魔咒反弹了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.81,1:20:50.77,*CHS,722,0,0,0,,那时，伏地魔灵魂的一个碎片…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.80,1:20:55.31,*CHS,723,0,0,0,,附着在了屋里唯一的活物身上…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.22,1:20:58.05,*CHS,724,0,0,0,,在哈利体内
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.00,1:21:02.95,*CHS,725,0,0,0,,哈利会蛇佬腔…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.99,1:21:07.06,*CHS,726,0,0,0,,能连接伏地魔的思想，都是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.20,1:21:15.36,*CHS,727,0,0,0,,伏地魔的一部分就活在他体内
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.79,1:21:23.78,*CHS,728,0,0,0,,就是说，到时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.68,1:21:27.86,*CHS,729,0,0,0,,那男孩儿就必须死？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.12,1:21:33.84,*CHS,730,0,0,0,,是的…他必须死
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.84,1:21:56.45,*CHS,731,0,0,0,,你让他活着，就为了让他在适当的时候再死？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.78,1:22:04.10,*CHS,732,0,0,0,,你养着他就像养一头待宰的猪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.14,1:22:08.81,*CHS,733,0,0,0,,可别跟我说，你对他产生感情了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.89,1:22:15.93,*CHS,734,0,0,0,,呼神护卫！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.39,1:22:28.96,*CHS,735,0,0,0,,莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.33,1:22:34.15,*CHS,736,0,0,0,,这么久了你还是…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.21,1:22:39.83,*CHS,737,0,0,0,,一直都是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.68,1:22:47.56,*CHS,738,0,0,0,,那么，到时候…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.00,1:22:50.88,*CHS,739,0,0,0,,那男孩儿就必须死？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.82,1:22:53.04,*CHS,740,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:57.64,*CHS,741,0,0,0,,他必须死，而且必须由伏地魔动手
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.77,1:23:00.99,*CHS,742,0,0,0,,这才是关键
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.91,1:24:08.29,*CHS,743,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿了？ - 我还以为你去了禁林
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.65,1:24:09.59,*CHS,744,0,0,0,,我这就去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.19,1:24:13.03,*CHS,745,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？别去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.16,1:24:16.04,*CHS,746,0,0,0,,你不能向他投降
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.11,1:24:21.49,*CHS,747,0,0,0,,怎么了，哈利？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:25.30,*CHS,748,0,0,0,,你知道什么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.16,1:24:30.41,*CHS,749,0,0,0,,我能听见是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.74,1:24:33.20,*CHS,750,0,0,0,,听见魂器
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.40,1:24:37.20,*CHS,751,0,0,0,,我应该早就想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.16,1:24:41.15,*CHS,752,0,0,0,,我觉得你们应该也想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.52,1:24:47.32,*CHS,753,0,0,0,,- 我要跟你一起去 - 不行，你们得杀了那条蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.19,1:24:50.54,*CHS,754,0,0,0,,杀了蛇，就只剩他了！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.18,1:26:06.67,*CHS,755,0,0,0,,(我在结束时打开)
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.57,1:26:12.25,*CHS,756,0,0,0,,我就要死了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.74,1:26:55.95,*CHS,757,0,0,0,,复活石
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.87,1:27:29.38,*CHS,758,0,0,0,,你一直很勇敢，宝贝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.37,1:27:37.32,*CHS,759,0,0,0,,你们怎么都在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.08,1:27:41.90,*CHS,760,0,0,0,,我们从未离开
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.96,1:27:52.48,*CHS,761,0,0,0,,那…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.59,1:27:54.89,*CHS,762,0,0,0,,疼吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.61,1:27:57.09,*CHS,763,0,0,0,,死？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.65,1:28:00.77,*CHS,764,0,0,0,,比睡着还快
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:06.58,*CHS,765,0,0,0,,只差一步了，儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.36,1:28:08.16,*CHS,766,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.95,1:28:11.29,*CHS,767,0,0,0,,我从来没想过要你们为我而死
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.78,1:28:15.23,*CHS,768,0,0,0,,莱姆斯，你刚有儿子…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.65,1:28:18.14,*CHS,769,0,0,0,,他会知道父母是为何牺牲的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.16,1:28:22.47,*CHS,770,0,0,0,,总有一天，他会明白
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.24,1:28:36.84,*CHS,771,0,0,0,,你们会陪着我么？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.44,1:28:39.88,*CHS,772,0,0,0,,直到最后
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.92,1:28:42.62,*CHS,773,0,0,0,,别人看不见你们么？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.19,1:28:44.61,*CHS,774,0,0,0,,看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.01,1:28:48.31,*CHS,775,0,0,0,,我们在你心里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.67,1:29:05.14,*CHS,776,0,0,0,,陪在我身边
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.05,1:29:08.99,*CHS,777,0,0,0,,一直都是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.05,1:29:27.28,*CHS,778,0,0,0,,他还是没出现，主人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.42,1:29:45.53,*CHS,779,0,0,0,,我以为他会来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.68,1:30:29.51,*CHS,780,0,0,0,,哈利，不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.55,1:30:32.09,*CHS,781,0,0,0,,- 为什么要来？ - 安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.90,1:30:45.54,*CHS,782,0,0,0,,哈利·波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.81,1:30:51.06,*CHS,783,0,0,0,,大难不死的男孩儿…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.64,1:30:57.86,*CHS,784,0,0,0,,前来受死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.03,1:31:19.08,*CHS,785,0,0,0,,阿瓦达索命！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.10,1:32:15.98,*CHS,786,0,0,0,,你帮不了…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.37,1:32:20.33,*CHS,787,0,0,0,,哈利，你真是好孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.79,1:32:24.20,*CHS,788,0,0,0,,最最勇敢的男子汉！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.55,1:32:29.10,*CHS,789,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.96,1:32:38.68,*CHS,790,0,0,0,,教授，那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.94,1:32:44.21,*CHS,791,0,0,0,,是我们无能为力的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.46,1:32:50.20,*CHS,792,0,0,0,,伏地魔的一部分在这里等待死亡
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.27,1:32:52.92,*CHS,793,0,0,0,,那这里到底是哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.93,1:32:55.60,*CHS,794,0,0,0,,我正想问你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.63,1:32:57.56,*CHS,795,0,0,0,,你说我们是在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.60,1:33:01.37,*CHS,796,0,0,0,,看样子像国王十字车站
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.86,1:33:04.64,*CHS,797,0,0,0,,但是更干净…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.67,1:33:06.66,*CHS,798,0,0,0,,没有火车
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.10,1:33:10.24,*CHS,799,0,0,0,,国王十字车站，真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.22,1:33:14.07,*CHS,800,0,0,0,,这就是人们说的:“你的地盘”
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.01,1:33:18.70,*CHS,801,0,0,0,,你现在应该知道你和伏地魔…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.74,1:33:21.81,*CHS,802,0,0,0,,你们的命运紧紧缠绕在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.85,1:33:25.05,*CHS,803,0,0,0,,从多年前戈德里克山谷那一晚开始
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.08,1:33:26.71,*CHS,804,0,0,0,,这么说是真的了，教授
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.75,1:33:29.29,*CHS,805,0,0,0,,他的一部分活在我的体内，是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.41,1:33:31.48,*CHS,806,0,0,0,,曾经在
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.84,1:33:35.74,*CHS,807,0,0,0,,那一部分刚刚被伏地魔亲自摧毁了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.68,1:33:41.50,*CHS,808,0,0,0,,你是他无意间造就的魂器，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.70,1:33:58.45,*CHS,809,0,0,0,,- 我必须回去，是吗？ - 这由你做主
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.49,1:34:01.30,*CHS,810,0,0,0,,- 我可以选择？ - 是的！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.43,1:34:04.29,*CHS,811,0,0,0,,你说我们在国王十字车站
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.26,1:34:10.84,*CHS,812,0,0,0,,我想如果你迫切要回去的话 应该会出现一列火车
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.43,1:34:13.87,*CHS,813,0,0,0,,它会把我带到哪儿呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.83,1:34:16.54,*CHS,814,0,0,0,,前方
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.67,1:34:36.96,*CHS,815,0,0,0,,伏地魔拥有老魔杖？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.79,1:34:40.58,*CHS,816,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.96,1:34:43.29,*CHS,817,0,0,0,,- 那条蛇还活着？ - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.40,1:34:46.23,*CHS,818,0,0,0,,可我没有武器可以杀它
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.22,1:34:51.31,*CHS,819,0,0,0,,在霍格沃茨，那些需要帮助的人总能得到帮助，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.75,1:34:56.65,*CHS,820,0,0,0,,我一直自诩很善于措辞
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:35:00.62,*CHS,821,0,0,0,,以我的愚见，语言…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.65,1:35:03.98,*CHS,822,0,0,0,,就像用之不竭的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.07,1:35:08.87,*CHS,823,0,0,0,,可以中伤他人，亦可抚慰忧伤
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.33,1:35:11.40,*CHS,824,0,0,0,,不过我现在想…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.20,1:35:14.62,*CHS,825,0,0,0,,把我的原话稍作改动，变成
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.26,1:35:23.45,*CHS,826,0,0,0,,在霍格沃茨，那些值得帮助的人总能得到帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.62,1:35:32.81,*CHS,827,0,0,0,,不要怜悯死者，哈利…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.59,1:35:34.80,*CHS,828,0,0,0,,怜悯活着的人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.18,1:35:37.18,*CHS,829,0,0,0,,尤其是那些…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.01,1:35:40.38,*CHS,830,0,0,0,,生命中没有爱的人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.80,1:35:44.26,*CHS,831,0,0,0,,教授，我母亲的守护神…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.83,1:35:47.06,*CHS,832,0,0,0,,是只母鹿，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.58,1:35:50.45,*CHS,833,0,0,0,,跟斯内普教授的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.95,1:35:53.88,*CHS,834,0,0,0,,你不觉得很奇怪么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.49,1:35:56.34,*CHS,835,0,0,0,,其实要我说…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.37,1:35:58.33,*CHS,836,0,0,0,,这一点也不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.04,1:36:02.57,*CHS,837,0,0,0,,我要走了，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.76,1:36:05.53,*CHS,838,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.22,1:36:11.13,*CHS,839,0,0,0,,这是真实的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.34,1:36:13.93,*CHS,840,0,0,0,,还是只是我脑海里的臆想？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.42,1:36:17.10,*CHS,841,0,0,0,,当然是你脑海里的臆想，哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.27,1:36:20.96,*CHS,842,0,0,0,,但为什么那就不能是真实的呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.42,1:36:29.21,*CHS,843,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.24,1:36:30.39,*CHS,844,0,0,0,,我该怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.44,1:36:36.42,*CHS,845,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.80,1:36:43.00,*CHS,846,0,0,0,,主人，我的主人，你受伤了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.60,1:36:45.59,*CHS,847,0,0,0,,我用不着你帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.91,1:37:00.07,*CHS,848,0,0,0,,那男孩儿…死了没？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.83,1:37:16.37,*CHS,849,0,0,0,,他还活着么？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.43,1:37:18.78,*CHS,850,0,0,0,,德拉科还活着么？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.03,1:37:47.71,*CHS,851,0,0,0,,死了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.61,1:39:17.03,*CHS,852,0,0,0,,那是谁？海格抱着的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.69,1:39:19.09,*CHS,853,0,0,0,,纳威，那是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.17,1:39:21.91,*CHS,854,0,0,0,,哈利·波特…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:26.80,*CHS,855,0,0,0,,- 死了！ - 不！不会的！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.80,1:39:28.42,*CHS,856,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.56,1:39:34.71,*CHS,857,0,0,0,,愚蠢！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.03,1:39:38.86,*CHS,858,0,0,0,,哈利·波特死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.20,1:39:41.06,*CHS,859,0,0,0,,从今天起…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.15,1:39:45.81,*CHS,860,0,0,0,,你们都得追随我
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.02,1:39:58.22,*CHS,861,0,0,0,,哈利波特死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.29,1:40:06.20,*CHS,862,0,0,0,,现在表明立场吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.28,1:40:14.95,*CHS,863,0,0,0,,要加入我的走上前…否则就死！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.48,1:40:21.07,*CHS,864,0,0,0,,德拉科！
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.89,1:40:27.65,*CHS,865,0,0,0,,德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.69,1:40:32.61,*CHS,866,0,0,0,,德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.35,1:40:37.32,*CHS,867,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.41,1:40:52.81,*CHS,868,0,0,0,,很好，德拉科
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.53,1:40:54.68,*CHS,869,0,0,0,,非常好！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.03,1:41:20.64,*CHS,870,0,0,0,,哈，比我期望的要糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.16,1:41:27.19,*CHS,871,0,0,0,,你是哪位，年轻人？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.05,1:41:30.17,*CHS,872,0,0,0,,纳威·隆巴顿
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.66,1:41:40.66,*CHS,873,0,0,0,,好吧纳威，我保证你会有用武之地的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.66,1:41:42.61,*CHS,874,0,0,0,,我有话要说
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.81,1:41:53.86,*CHS,875,0,0,0,,好吧纳威，我倒要听听你想说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.86,1:42:00.14,*CHS,876,0,0,0,,- 哈利死了也没关系 - 别说了，纳威！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.14,1:42:01.88,*CHS,877,0,0,0,,每天都有人死！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.47,1:42:08.62,*CHS,878,0,0,0,,朋友，家人…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.63,1:42:12.12,*CHS,879,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.74,1:42:15.68,*CHS,880,0,0,0,,今晚我们失去了哈利
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.64,1:42:18.87,*CHS,881,0,0,0,,但他还在
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.17,1:42:21.33,*CHS,882,0,0,0,,在我们心里
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.02,1:42:27.14,*CHS,883,0,0,0,,弗雷德、莱姆斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.56,1:42:30.16,*CHS,884,0,0,0,,唐克斯…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.43,1:42:33.33,*CHS,885,0,0,0,,他们都在
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.58,1:42:36.12,*CHS,886,0,0,0,,他们没有白白牺牲！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.03,1:42:43.23,*CHS,887,0,0,0,,但是你会！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.67,1:42:44.82,*CHS,888,0,0,0,,因为你错了！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.78,1:42:47.60,*CHS,889,0,0,0,,哈利是为我们而战
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.81,1:42:49.01,*CHS,890,0,0,0,,为我们所有人！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.22,1:42:50.56,*CHS,891,0,0,0,,还没结束！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.21,1:42:56.95,*CHS,892,0,0,0,,霹雳爆炸！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.22,1:43:13.58,*CHS,893,0,0,0,,回来战斗！回来！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.46,1:43:19.23,*CHS,894,0,0,0,,大家都进城堡！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.23,1:43:20.66,*CHS,895,0,0,0,,我们得杀了那只蛇
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.66,1:43:21.52,*CHS,896,0,0,0,,拿着毒牙！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.53,1:43:22.31,*CHS,897,0,0,0,,纳威！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.48,1:46:19.68,*CHS,898,0,0,0,,不许碰我女儿，贱人！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.47,1:46:53.64,*CHS,899,0,0,0,,其实你说对了…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.54,1:46:57.76,*CHS,900,0,0,0,,你跟斯内普教授说那根魔杖不听你的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.76,1:46:58.79,*CHS,901,0,0,0,,它本来…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.03,1:47:02.82,*CHS,902,0,0,0,,我杀了斯内普！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.82,1:47:04.68,*CHS,903,0,0,0,,可如果魔杖根本不属于斯内普呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.90,1:47:07.25,*CHS,904,0,0,0,,如果魔杖效忠的一直另有其人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.07,1:47:09.12,*CHS,905,0,0,0,,来吧，汤姆…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.37,1:47:11.70,*CHS,906,0,0,0,,我们开始的由我们来结束
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.96,1:47:13.38,*CHS,907,0,0,0,,做个了断吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.00,1:51:00.17,*CHS,908,0,0,0,,哈利！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.67,1:52:03.79,*CHS,909,0,0,0,,老魔杖为什么不听他的呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.46,1:52:07.41,*CHS,910,0,0,0,,老魔杖效忠的另有其人
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.24,1:52:11.19,*CHS,911,0,0,0,,他以为杀了斯内普，魔杖就会属于他
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.19,1:52:12.33,*CHS,912,0,0,0,,但实际上…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.42,1:52:14.89,*CHS,913,0,0,0,,魔杖从来都不属于斯内普
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.76,1:52:19.49,*CHS,914,0,0,0,,天文塔那晚，邓布利多是被德拉科解除武器的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.35,1:52:23.80,*CHS,915,0,0,0,,从那时起，魔杖就效忠于他
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.42,1:52:29.73,*CHS,916,0,0,0,,直到那晚他被我解除武器
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.07,1:52:31.77,*CHS,917,0,0,0,,在马尔福庄园
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.77,1:52:33.43,*CHS,918,0,0,0,,那就是说…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.57,1:52:36.71,*CHS,919,0,0,0,,魔杖属于我！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.39,1:52:42.42,*CHS,920,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么处理？ - 我们？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.40,1:52:45.04,*CHS,921,0,0,0,,我是说，那可是老魔杖啊
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.39,1:52:47.54,*CHS,922,0,0,0,,世界上最厉害的魔杖
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.12,1:52:51.13,*CHS,923,0,0,0,,有了它，就能战无不胜
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.54,1:54:24.29,*CHS,924,0,0,0,,(19年后)
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.90,1:55:16.08,*CHS,925,0,0,0,,一起走
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.29,1:55:56.79,*CHS,926,0,0,0,,- 书包？ - 拿了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.27,1:55:58.49,*CHS,927,0,0,0,,毛衣？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.40,1:56:02.02,*CHS,928,0,0,0,,我会想你的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.85,1:56:04.33,*CHS,929,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.97,1:56:20.80,*CHS,930,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.49,1:56:23.58,*CHS,931,0,0,0,,要是我被分到斯莱特林怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.34,1:56:33.12,*CHS,932,0,0,0,,阿不思·西弗勒斯·波特 你是以霍格沃茨两位校长的名字命名的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.91,1:56:39.08,*CHS,933,0,0,0,,其中之一就毕业于斯莱特林学院 他也是我见过的最勇敢的人
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.08,1:56:44.08,*CHS,934,0,0,0,,- 可是如果我… - 那么斯莱特林学院
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.09,1:56:47.68,*CHS,935,0,0,0,,就会拥有一名优秀的小巫师
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.60,1:56:49.89,*CHS,936,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.99,1:56:53.68,*CHS,937,0,0,0,,如果你真的很在意，你可以选择格兰芬多
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.25,1:56:56.78,*CHS,938,0,0,0,,分院帽会考虑你的选择
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.29,1:56:59.97,*CHS,939,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.87,1:57:06.00,*CHS,940,0,0,0,,- 准备好了？ - 好了
